 -rn \"gt:0\\|'gt:\\|lt:0\\|:value\" tests/Validation/ValidationValidatorTest.php | head -40\n      grep -rn \"ITERATING_\\|FAILED_NONE\\|FAILED_SETUP\\|FAILED_TASKS\\|FAILED_RESCUE\\|FAILED_ALWAYS\\|IteratingStates\\|FailedStates\" --include=\"*.py\" --include\n      grep -rn \"IteratingStates\\|FailedStates\\|itr\\.\\|_play_iterator\\|play_iterator\" test/units/executor/test_play_iterator.py | head -60\n      grep -rn \"version\\s*=\\|__version__\" lib/ansible/release.py; grep -rn \"python_requires\" setup.cfg\n      grep -rn \"run_state\\|fail_state\" --include=\"*.py\" lib/ test/ bin/ | grep -v \"lib/ansible/executor/play_iterator.py\" | grep -v \"^test/units/executor/te\n      grep -rn \"from ansible.executor.play_iterator import\\|import play_iterator\" --include=\"*.py\" lib/ test/ | head -20\n      grep -n \"def deprecated\" -A 30 lib/ansible/utils/display.py\n      grep -rn \"def get_deprecation_message\" -A 40 lib/ansible/module_utils/common/warnings.py lib/ansible/utils/*.py 2>/dev/null | head -60\n\n### baseline: shell-expl=995  graph=0  phases={'grep_pre': 273, 'grep_post': 136}\n   heads: {'grep': 409, 'ls': 263, 'cd': 219, 'sed': 161, 'cat': 107, 'git': 98, 'mkdir': 51, 'python': 43, 'rm': 41, 'timeout': 37, 'find': 36, 'python3': 35}","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e6056e10-1e18-4551-8b61-89e968d71d3f","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"e604db67-6ee2-4ef3-870e-0deb55c551c0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdpwswTFbdwkBXSoeAwCx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3990,"cache_read_input_tokens":109279,"output_tokens":3003,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3990,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3003,"cache_read_input_tokens":109279,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3990,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3990},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdpwsvSUf3nYwzQcJUixZ","type":"assistant","uuid":"48ef8315-2e8d-4d44-936b-861e416c1183","timestamp":"2026-08-08T08:14:35.198Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"48ef8315-2e8d-4d44-936b-861e416c1183","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdpwswTFbdwkBXSoeAwCx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This inverts my earlier conclusion, and I should say plainly where I went wrong: I computed \"addressable\" on the **delta between arms**, which treats eg's current behaviour as fixed. The right denominator is the baseline's exploration pool, and it's large.\n\n## The mechanism, measured on all 49 pairs\n\n| | baseline | eg |\n|---|---|---|\n| shell exploration calls | 995 | 905 |\n| graph calls | 0 | 94 |\n| **total exploration** | **995** | **999** |\n\n**One graph call displaces 0.96 shell calls.** It has to displace >1 just to break even on messages — which is why turns went *up* 38 and the headline sits at +1.35%. Nothing about payload quality or ranking was ever going to move that ratio.\n\nThe correlation confirms it's the governing variable: `corr(exploration eliminated, tokens saved) = +0.485`, slope 0.767, n=49. Instances where eg explored *more* (18/49): mean **−27.4%**. Instances in the 25–50% elimination band (n=9): mean **+28.4%**.\n\n## Why the ratio is 1:1 — the surviving greps are capability gaps, not stubbornness\n\nPhase split: `graph_pre=91 / grep_pre=232`, `graph_post=3 / grep_post=125`. Reading the 357 greps, four classes dominate and each maps to a verb the graph doesn't have:\n\n| what the grep asks | example | graph today |\n|---|---|---|\n| **multi-symbol lookup in one call** | `grep -rn \"calc_interval\\|raw_interval\\|calc_max_retry_timeout\\|recalc_next_time\\|naive_next_time\"` | `def` takes **one** symbol — so grep wins on batching alone |\n| **scoped search inside a known file/dir** | `grep -n \"retry_wait\\|backoff\" test/plugin/test_output_as_buffered_retries.rb` | no `--path` scoping verb |\n| **find the test covering X** | `grep -rn \"greater than\" tests/Validation/` | `TESTS` = **10 edges of 36,114**, name-convention only — dead |\n| **who imports this module** | `grep -rn \"from ansible.executor.play_iterator import\"` | `IMPORTS` edges exist, **no verb exposes them** |\n\nThe agent batches 5–9 alternation patterns into one grep. A single-symbol `def` cannot compete with that, so the agent correctly prefers grep. That is a tool defect, and fixing it is pure tool output — no instructions, nothing the baseline could use.\n\n## The arithmetic, restated with the right denominator\n\n35% needs 556 of 2671 turns removed. At 94 graph calls that requires a 7:1 displacement ratio; at 150 calls, 5:1. Today: 0.96:1. The band that already achieves ~2:1 measures +28.4%.\n\nI'm not claiming 35% yet — the +28.4% band is n=9 and the same-instance noise floor is ~100pt. But the ceiling I gave you was computed wrong, and the lever is concrete and buildable. Starting on the four verb gaps, highest displacement-per-call first."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3990,"cache_read_input_tokens":109279,"output_tokens":3003,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3990,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3003,"cache_read_input_tokens":109279,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3990,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3990},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdpwsvSUf3nYwzQcJUixZ","type":"assistant","uuid":"a4cc31a0-d8b0-4bb3-a1e3-3d624a528489","timestamp":"2026-08-08T08:14:48.728Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
