{"parentUuid":"c5fcf148-818c-484d-aa1e-93dd5e96ab11","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdpxCcgutmXnooj4djbsG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now the mechanism is fully exposed, and it is an economics problem, not an adoption problem:\n\n| call | bytes | lines | answers |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| grep, 5 symbols | **1,889** | 18 | where all 5 are |\n| `def` ×5 separate calls | 11,355 | — | same + bodies |\n| `def A B C D E`, one call | **11,482** | 290 | same + bodies |\n\nMulti-query saves 4 messages but ships **6.1× the bytes**. And the capability is unreachable anyway — the binary accepts N symbols, but eg-q's `def` branch passes only `$arg`:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1391,"cache_read_input_tokens":127095,"output_tokens":1787,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1391,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1787,"cache_read_input_tokens":127095,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1391,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1391},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdpxCZvyEVGZWivMR344M","type":"assistant","uuid":"2f89f401-a189-4bce-a600-c608ef2f0d5e","timestamp":"2026-08-08T08:18:44.937Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
