{"parentUuid":"fbdb900c-06fd-4a61-a92a-77dbfdbd79cd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdpyMZjgYiJv5pMSi18af","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NtTcjFv7F1grxu8G7ct21X","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/graphmark-bench && git add agentic-swebench/tools/eg-q agentic-swebench/tools/run_3arm.sh && git commit -q -F - <<'MSG'\nharness: reach the batched-name and path-scoped forms from the arm\n\neg-q set arg=\"$*\" and handed the JOINED string to the binary as one symbol, so\n`eg-q def A B C` fuzzy-missed and printed a no-exact-match card. The binary has\naccepted several names since the multi-query commit, whose own parser comment\nsays why: \"Agents batch shell calls under the prompt's batching rule ... a tool\nthat answers one name per invocation cannot compete with that.\" The capability\nexisted and was unreachable from the arm that needed it -- and what it produced\ninstead was refusal-shaped output, the exact failure the never-refuse work was\nwritten to stop.\n\nBatched form now passes the names through and asks for --brief, because\ndisplacing a grep is a contest of bytes as well as messages: batched grep\n1,889 B, def with bodies 11,482 B, def --brief 895 B. Single-symbol keeps the\nfull-body path unchanged.\n\n--path is pulled out of argv before the query is rebuilt and forwarded to both\nsearch call sites, preserving word order (arg is a natural-language query and\nreordering it changes retrieval).\n\nNeither path may exit: the case runs inside the `{ ... } > \"$_egq_out\"` group\nand the bytes the agent receives are printed after esac, so an early exit would\nwrite the answer to a temp file and die before it was shown -- a silent empty\nresponse, the payload-announced-but-never-shipped class again.\n\nAffordance updated in both prompt variants, capability-only: the no-tool arm has\nno analogue for a verb, so this is the same class of difference as the search\npayload itself.\nMSG\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Commit harness changes"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2620,"cache_read_input_tokens":180805,"output_tokens":686,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2620,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":686,"cache_read_input_tokens":180805,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2620,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2620},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdpyMW7QEijVf79XK6qdG","type":"assistant","uuid":"b8c16e53-91db-42a0-99dd-3b1f49519263","timestamp":"2026-08-08T08:33:36.425Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
