{"parentUuid":"c0bf8a58-debb-4edd-9aed-a2f0de5d060e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cdq7v8sZYEzLN7AUf4TYb","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Status — G3 complete, and it failed its gate**\n\n| cell | arm | n | TOKEN | CI | median | wins |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| rep50 4-arm | eg | 49/49 | +1.35% | [−16.9, +18.1] | −4.2% | 24/49 |\n| | cmm | 49/49 | −5.95% | [−28.2, +13.3] | −2.9% | 22/49 |\n| | graphify | 48/49 | −0.50% | [−16.4, +13.9] | −8.1% | 18/48 |\n| G2 (rider) | eg vs base | 9 | −14.48% | — | −24.82% | 3/9 |\n| **G3 (displacement)** | eg vs base | **11** | −1.24% | — | −0.40% | 5/11 |\n| Gemini 300 | — | 207 | −8.78% | — | — | VM A preempted |\n| rep30 | — | — | — | — | — | VM B preempted, 52 unfinished |\n\n**Gate result — FAIL:**\n\n| | rep50 | G3 |\n|---|---|---|\n| displacement ratio | 0.96 | **0.76** |\n| baseline shell-expl | 995 | 325 |\n| eg shell-expl | 905 | 300 |\n| eg graph calls | 94 | 33 |\n| total exploration | −0.4% | **−2.5%** |\n| Δturns | −1.4% | −2.2% |\n\nCriterion was ≥2.0. It moved the wrong way. Graph calls rose (1.9 → 3.1/session) but each displaced *less*, so total exploration and turns both got slightly worse.\n\n**Flags:** wt 0 · cmm SKIP 0 · graphify SKIP 0 · none arm-asymmetric. eg max-turns 1 (`lombok-3674`). Open: `carbon-2981` baseline 371 KB patch, `EMPTY PAYLOAD` detector bug.\n\n**The mechanism is now measured, not inferred:** `--path` was used **0 times in 12 sessions** despite being reachable, advertised in both prompt variants, and covering 65% of the grep class. Batched `def` got 6 calls. That is the third capability in a row — `impact` 0/49, `changed` 0/5, `--path` 0/12 — where building the verb changed nothing because the agent doesn't reach for it. The wall is adoption, not capability, and adding a fourth verb won't clear it."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1613,"cache_read_input_tokens":264212,"output_tokens":831,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1613,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":831,"cache_read_input_tokens":264212,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1613,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1613},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cdq7v7Wht4YWUo43S26BK","type":"assistant","uuid":"994a8647-2877-4808-9ce0-84fc02059d04","timestamp":"2026-08-08T10:25:54.730Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
