{"parentUuid":"ab2ffddc-2461-434d-9e29-cae4785eb681","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqCvtJpNYhUyyS3cLdpR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've driven the OAuth flow to the authentication step and it needs you — Google is requiring a **passkey**, so there should now be a Touch ID prompt on your Mac.\n\n**Please touch the Touch ID sensor** (or pick \"Try another way\" in the tab if you'd rather use a different method).\n\nOnce you do, the page lands on a consent screen and then shows a verification code. I've got a `gcloud auth login` process parked and waiting on stdin, so as soon as the code appears I'll read it from the page and feed it in — you don't need to copy anything. Then all the VM polling resumes.\n\nTwo notes:\n- The account is **suhaan@entire.io**, not `suhaanm@entire.io` — that's the only entire.io account signed in, and it matches the VM user `suhaan_entire_io`. I restarted the flow against it after the first attempt used the address as you typed it.\n- I won't type a password on your behalf. If it falls back to asking for one instead of the passkey, tell me and I'll hand the URL over for you to finish directly.\n\nMeanwhile, the benchmark state is unchanged and nothing is at risk: rep50 eg **+1.35%** (n=49), cmm −5.95%, graphify −0.50%; G2 −14.48% (n=9); G3 finished at **−1.24%** (n=11) and **failed its gate** — displacement ratio 0.76 against a ≥2.0 criterion, with `--path` used 0 times in 12 sessions."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1618,"cache_read_input_tokens":305682,"output_tokens":487,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1618,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":487,"cache_read_input_tokens":305682,"cache_