{"parentUuid":"07916ed0-6195-4e69-958d-8a906a9dfbd2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqSqF2iirxuyJLwaYHoh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Status**\n\n| cell | arm | n | TOKEN | CI | median | wins |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| rep50 4-arm | eg | 49/49 | +1.35% | [−16.9, +18.1] | −4.2% | 24/49 |\n| | cmm | 49/49 | −5.95% | [−28.2, +13.3] | −2.9% | 22/49 |\n| | graphify | 48/49 | −0.50% | [−16.4, +13.9] | −8.1% | 18/48 |\n| G2 (rider) | eg vs base | 10 | −12.19% | — | −14.45% | 3/10 |\n| G3 (displacement) | eg vs base | 11 | −1.24% | — | −0.40% | 5/11 |\n| Gemini 300 | — | 207 | −8.78% | — | — | VM A terminated |\n| rep30 | — | — | — | — | — | VM B terminated, 52 unfinished |\n\n**Flags:** wt 0 · cmm SKIP 0 · graphify SKIP 0 · max-turns 1 · none arm-asymmetric. Open: `carbon-2981` 371 KB baseline patch, `EMPTY PAYLOAD` detector bug.\n\n**Changed — and it partly un-kills R-B.** I checked whether the graph-backed `grep` verb (which already ships, 44 calls) displaces shell work:\n\n| group | n | eg shell | base shell | eliminated | TOKEN |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| uses `eg-q grep` | 34 | 608 | 723 | **15.9%** | **+8.38%** |\n| never uses it | 15 | 297 | 272 | **−9.2%** | **−11.24%** |\n| uses it 2+ times | 8 | 100 | 140 | **28.6%** | +7.35% |\n\nSessions that route greps through the graph eliminate 15.9% of shell exploration and land **+8.38%**; sessions that don't *add* 9.2% and land **−11.24%**. A 19.6-point spread on the same cell.\n\nThat's correlational — the 15 non-users may simply be harder instances — but it's the first thing measured that separates the halves and points at a mechanism already in the tool rather than a new one. It also means the grep-interception idea is testable without building a shim: raise `eg-q grep` usage from 0.9/session and see if elimination follows.\n\nI'll test that confound next (are the non-users harder?) before treating it as a lever."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3344,"cache_read_input_tokens":432737,"output_tokens":839,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3344,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":839,"cache_read_input_tokens":432737,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3344,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3344},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqSq96H9Gqmif7A3wfix","type":"assistant","uuid":"1c0436de-5288-4306-b1be-dcee9c1e4b75","timestamp":"2026-08-08T14:33:58.607Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
