{"parentUuid":"588be2c5-3edb-4908-98d6-0513149fc06c","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"cea693fe-c867-4693-a066-c1fb89c13c8d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QofNQdS2y8J4ZmVKqeLWyN","type":"tool_result","content":"CONFOUND 1 — are non-users simply cheaper/easier instances?\n  uses eg-q grep     n=34  base median  2.31M  base median turns  51  base median shell  17\n  never uses it      n=15  base median  3.11M  base median turns  61  base median shell  17\n\nCONFOUND 2 — stratify by baseline cost tercile, then split on grep usage\n  cheap      uses  n=14  TOKEN  -25.41%  shell elim  +18.0%\n  cheap      non   n= 2  TOKEN  -55.09%  shell elim  -35.3%\n  mid        uses  n=10  TOKEN   +5.78%  shell elim  +11.1%\n  mid        non   n= 6  TOKEN  -17.93%  shell elim  -14.3%\n  expensive  uses  n=10  TOKEN  +18.16%  shell elim  +17.2%\n  expensive  non   n= 7  TOKEN   -7.09%  shell elim   -3.2%\n\nCONFOUND 3 — is it usage, or just 'the tool returned something'?\n  any graph call   n=46  TOKEN   +0.64%  shell elim  +10.3%\n  search only      n=12  TOKEN  -15.72%  shell elim   -7.3%\n  def used         n=19  TOKEN   +6.94%  shell elim  +19.3%\n\ncorr(eg-q grep calls, shell elimination) = +0.304  n=49","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"6186820f-35a8-4f99-b47f-bae8b4c6df76","timestamp":"2026-08-08T14:36:42.187Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"CONFOUND 1 — are non-users simply cheaper/easier instances?\n  uses eg-q grep     n=34  base median  2.31M  base median turns  51  base median shell  17\n  never uses it      n=15  base median  3.11M  base median turns  61  base median shell  17\n\nCONFOUND 2 — stratify by baseline cost tercile, then split on grep usage\n  cheap      uses  n=14  TOKEN  -25.41%  shell elim  +18.0%\n  cheap      non   n= 2  TOKEN  -55.09%  shell elim  -35.3%\n  mid        uses  n=10  TOKEN   +5.78%  shell elim  +11.1%\n  mid        non   n= 6  TOKEN  -17.93%  shell elim  -14.3%\n  expensive  uses  n=10  TOKEN  +18.16%  shell elim  +17.2%\n  expensive  non   n= 7  TOKEN   -7.09%  shell elim   -3.2%\n\nCONFOUND 3 — is it usage, or just 'the tool returned something'?\n  any graph call   n=46  TOKEN   +0.64%  shell elim  +10.3%\n  search only      n=12  TOKEN  -15.72%  shell elim   -7.3%\n  def used         n=19  TOKEN   +6.94%  shell elim  +19.3%\n\ncorr(eg-q grep calls, shell elimination) = +0.304  n=49","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"588be2c5-3edb-4908-98d6-0513149fc06c","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"6186820f-35a8-4f99-b47f-bae8b4c6df76","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqT4QMAUY1QV1PnQLjjF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3309,"cache_read_input_tokens":436953,"output_tokens":2069,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3309,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2069,"cache_read_input_tokens":436953,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3309,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3309},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqT4FPABEJG7z6gJNzhp","type":"assistant","uuid":"6dedbf3f-602e-4590-9e2f-23be4fd06d42","timestamp":"2026-08-08T14:37:06.727Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"6dedbf3f-602e-4590-9e2f-23be4fd06d42","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqT4QMAUY1QV1PnQLjjF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Confounds checked — and the result strengthens rather than dissolves:\n\n**1. Non-users are not easier instances.** Their baselines are *more expensive* (3.11M vs 2.31M median) and longer (61 vs 51 turns), identical shell counts. Since expensive baselines are known to *favour* eg (`corr = +0.305`), the confound runs against the effect.\n\n**2. It holds inside every cost tercile:**\n\n| tercile | uses `eg-q grep` | never uses | gap |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| cheap | −25.41% | −55.09% | 30 pts |\n| mid | +5.78% | −17.93% | 24 pts |\n| expensive | +18.16% | −7.09% | 25 pts |\n\n**3. And it isolates to *which* verb — this is the new finding:**\n\n| group | n | TOKEN | shell eliminated |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| any graph call | 46 | +0.64% | +10.3% |\n| **`search` only, no grep** | 12 | **−15.72%** | **−7.3%** |\n| `def` used | 19 | **+6.94%** | **+19.3%** |\n| `grep` used | 34 | +8.38% | +15.9% |\n\n`corr(eg-q grep calls, shell elimination) = +0.304`.\n\n**Search-only sessions are the worst group in the cell** — they cost a turn and the agent explores *more* afterwards. The verbs that answer a *specific* question (`def <Symbol>`, `grep <literal>`) displace shell work; the verb that answers a *vague* one does not.\n\nThat contradicts the shipped doctrine, which makes `search` the mandatory first action (`.entire/graph-agent.md`: *\"Your FIRST action must be ONE search\"*). Changing which verb leads is a capability statement, not a frugality instruction — a no-tool arm can't invoke `def` either — so it's fair.\n\n**Remaining confound, and it's the serious one:** using `def`/`grep` requires the issue to *name* a symbol. That's the ledger's live MOD-vs-ADD hypothesis — verb choice may be a *marker* of tractable tasks rather than a cause. Testing that now, since it decides whether this is a lever or a thermometer."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3309,"cache_read_input_tokens":436953,"output_tokens":2069,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3309,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2069,"cache_read_input_tokens":436953,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3309,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3309},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqT4FPABEJG7z6gJNzhp","type":"assistant","uuid":"495113c4-911f-4ce2-9181-d909d5f1fe37","timestamp":"2026-08-08T14:37:14.055Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
