{"parentUuid":"002cd4ea-0890-4dd8-9fb0-d4eb2c025c1c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqT9EJZeNW246VVJhwGe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Status**\n\n| cell | arm | n | TOKEN | CI | median | wins |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| rep50 4-arm | eg | 49/49 | +1.35% | [−16.9, +18.1] | −4.2% | 24/49 |\n| | cmm | 49/49 | −5.95% | [−28.2, +13.3] | −2.9% | 22/49 |\n| | graphify | 48/49 | −0.50% | [−16.4, +13.9] | −8.1% | 18/48 |\n| G2 (rider) | eg vs base | 10 | −12.19% | — | −14.45% | 3/10 |\n| G3 (displacement) | eg vs base | 11 | −1.24% | — | −0.40% | 5/11 |\n| Gemini 300 | — | 207 | −8.78% | — | — | VM A terminated |\n| rep30 | — | — | — | — | — | VM B terminated, 52 unfinished |\n\n**Flags:** wt 0 · cmm SKIP 0 · graphify SKIP 0 · max-turns 1 · none arm-asymmetric. Open: `carbon-2981` 371 KB baseline patch, `EMPTY PAYLOAD` detector bug.\n\n**Changed — the thermometer test came back, and the verb effect survives it.**\n\nThe worry was that `def`/`grep` usage just marks tasks whose issue names a symbol (the MOD-vs-ADD hypothesis). Two results kill that reading:\n\n- **Nameability doesn't predict verb choice at all** — users median 171, non-users **196**. Non-users' issues are *more* symbol-rich, not less.\n- **The gap holds inside both halves:**\n\n| | uses `def`/`grep` | never | gap |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| low nameability (24) | −2.95% | **−28.11%** | 25 pts |\n| high nameability (25) | **+17.12%** | −11.49% | 29 pts |\n\nShell elimination tracks it exactly: +8.4%/+19.4% for users, **−11.6%/−11.8%** for non-users — non-users explore *more* than the no-tool baseline in both halves.\n\nSo verb choice is a lever, not a thermometer, and it's the largest fair effect measured on this cell. The high-nameability + targeted-verb cell runs **+17.12%**, which is the best fair number the project has produced, reproduced here independently of the opus-xhigh cell.\n\nStill correlational on one cell, and it can't reach 35% — but it's the first thing that survives its own confound check. Next: whether the shipped doctrine's *\"FIRST action must be ONE search\"* is actively causing the search-only group's −15.72%."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2944,"cache_read_input_tokens":442450,"output_tokens":908,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2944,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":908,"cache_read_input_tokens":442450,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2944,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2944},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqT988z8JdyVxzTn5dbf","type":"assistant","uuid":"c0cfe3a1-bbc0-4e08-9070-0b5ca5937190","timestamp":"2026-08-08T14:38:03.977Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
