{"parentUuid":"c55fdf1b-da2b-4ca6-998c-a4ce3ca45d0d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqTVpvUBF4qB866AfLrY","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Status**\n\n| cell | arm | n | TOKEN | CI | median | wins |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| rep50 4-arm | eg | 49/49 | +1.35% | [−16.9, +18.1] | −4.2% | 24/49 |\n| | cmm | 49/49 | −5.95% | [−28.2, +13.3] | −2.9% | 22/49 |\n| | graphify | 48/49 | −0.50% | [−16.4, +13.9] | −8.1% | 18/48 |\n| G2 (rider) | eg vs base | 10 | −12.19% | — | −14.45% | 3/10 |\n| G3 (displacement) | eg vs base | 11 | −1.24% | — | −0.40% | 5/11 |\n| Gemini 300 | — | 207 | −8.78% | — | — | VM A terminated |\n| rep30 | — | — | — | — | — | VM B terminated, 52 unfinished |\n\n**Flags:** wt 0 · cmm SKIP 0 · graphify SKIP 0 · max-turns 1 · none arm-asymmetric. Open: `carbon-2981` 371 KB baseline patch, `EMPTY PAYLOAD` detector bug.\n\n**Changed — the ordering test came back mixed, and it exposes a contradiction I have to flag rather than paper over.**\n\n| split | n | TOKEN | shell elim |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| targeted verb used anywhere | 38 | **+9.67%** | +15.0% |\n| search/none only | 11 | **−18.37%** | −11.7% |\n| first verb = `search` | 30 | +2.21% | +14.1% |\n| first verb = `def` | 6 | **−74.42%** | +2.8% |\n| 1 graph call | 13 | −9.12% | −14.3% |\n| **3+ graph calls** | 18 | **+15.48%** | **+24.3%** |\n\nTwo problems with reading this as a lever:\n\n1. **`def`-first is catastrophic (−74%) while `def`-anywhere is positive.** At n=6 that's noise, but it means \"lead with the targeted verb\" is *not* supported — only \"use one at some point\" is.\n2. **The 3+ calls row contradicts G3.** G3 measured more calls → *less* displacement (1.9→3.1, ratio 0.96→0.76). Here more calls → more displacement. Both can't be causal, and the ledger already struck graph-call dose-response (§2.7) for exactly this reason.\n\nThe honest reading: call count and verb choice are largely **markers of whether the tool's answer landed**, not causes of it. The one result that survived an explicit confound check is verb-use-within-nameability-strata (25–29 pt gap in both halves) — that one I still believe.\n\nI'm not going to promote the rest to a lever on correlational splits of a single cell; that's how the eleven dead payload metrics were born."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2597,"cache_read_input_tokens":446420,"output_tokens":1886,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2597,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1886,"cache_read_input_tokens":446420,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2597,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2597},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqTVhbSqYsBUWsfnqELY","type":"assistant","uuid":"139ba3f1-f1b0-4004-99b0-12f617883707","timestamp":"2026-08-08T14:42:57.771Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
