{"parentUuid":"f4cef3f3-18d7-4647-a39b-6972bbfc3c1f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqTyZLPEe7uCscejYrjK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The harness already implements the injection (`EG_PREFETCH=1`), and its comment carries a *second* independent measurement:\n\n> *\"The payload makes every turn CHEAPER (30,302 → 29,334 tokens/turn, −3.2%) and total tokens still rose +3.0%, because TURNS rose 13.40 → 13.72. That +0.32 decomposes exactly: +1.00 graph call − 0.89 greps saved + 0.33 induced reads. **The single graph call IS the entire cost. Remove it and Opus is −3.2% before anything else changes.** … Untested at session level.\"*\n\nTwo independent bases now agree the call costs more than it returns. rep50 ran with `EG_PREFETCH=0`, so this has never been run. Checking the two wiring conditions that decide whether it actually works:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1059,"cache_read_input_tokens":460821,"output_tokens":1889,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1059,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1889,"cache_read_input_tokens":460821,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1059,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1059},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqTyQfzHSGfmDykb3Wfy","type":"assistant","uuid":"bd96e1c6-1bae-4851-a3c1-52f48c97ee47","timestamp":"2026-08-08T14:49:04.698Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"bd96e1c6-1bae-4851-a3c1-52f48c97ee47","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqTyZLPEe7uCscejYrjK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EEYYoeCJseD4qxHMvEehM6","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/graphmark-bench/agentic-swebench\necho \"=== (a) does EG_PREFETCH=1 also set EG_PRESEARCH for the session? ===\"\ngrep -n \"EG_PRESEARCH\\|ENTIRE_GRAPH_PRESEARCH\" tools/*.sh tools/eg-q 2>/dev/null | head\necho \"--- (none above = NOT wired) ---\"\necho\necho \"=== (b) is the 'search first' directive still in the prompt when prefetch is on? ===\"\nsed -n '640,700p' tools/run_3arm.sh | grep -n \"prefetch.payload\\|FIRST action\\|search \\\"<the bug\\|already been run\\|PREFETCH\" | head\necho\necho \"=== how the payload reaches the prompt ===\"\ngrep -n 'prefetch.payload' tools/run_3arm.sh | sed -n '5,20p'","description":"Verify prefetch wiring conditions"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1059,"cache_read_input_tokens":460821,"output_tokens":1889,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1059,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1889,"cache_read_input_tokens":460821,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1059,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1059},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqTyQfzHSGfmDykb3Wfy","type":"assistant","uuid":"5deab811-525e-45a5-b315-b23582b3b3fc","timestamp":"2026-08-08T14:49:08.262Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220",