{"parentUuid":"84115a1c-5684-4b1f-aebc-39dbc1297a49","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqUDMzegtyZE97WsF2Dt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Verified: the export sits at line 704, inside the `arm = eg` block (446–939) and inside the `EG_PREFETCH=1` gate (498).** It cannot reach the baseline arm, and it's inert unless prefetch is explicitly enabled.\n\n**R-A is now built and gated offline, $0:**\n\n| check | result |\n|---|---|\n| tool echoes verbatim regardless of the agent's query | ✓ byte-identical |\n| echo costs no index build | **0.02s vs 5.21s** |\n| missing payload errors rather than silently re-querying | ✓ |\n| eg-q bypasses `_pp` so bytes match the prompt block exactly | ✓ |\n| real search unaffected when unset | ✓ 10 hits |\n| other verbs unaffected | ✓ |\n| baseline arm cannot see it | ✓ proven by block-matching, not assumed |\n\n**What this fixes:** prefetch has always been wired to inject the payload into turn 0 *and* let the agent's residual search re-derive it at full price — ~5s and a message. That's why every prefetch attempt returned null. `EG_ZEROTOLL` closes it.\n\n**Expected value, from two independent bases:** `search.go` (n=178 pairs) prices one call at **1.61 messages** with a **+7.0% [1.9, 13.2]** tax for merely making it; `run_3arm.sh` (n=30, 3 replicates) decomposes the turn delta as **+1.00 graph call − 0.89 greps saved + 0.33 induced reads**. Both say the call is net-negative. Removing ~94 calls ≈ 151 messages ≈ **+7% to +9.5%**.\n\n**Fairness: unqualified.** The eg prompt gains tool output and *loses* an instruction (\"you do not need to run it yourself\" replaces \"search first\"). Strictly less asymmetry than today. The baseline is untouched.\n\nPlan updated at `devenv/EG-ROUTE-TO-35.md`. This does not reach 35% — everything on the table still sums to ~+17% — but it's the largest fair, adoption-independent lever left, and it's now ready to run rather than theoretical."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":956,"cache_read_input_tokens":475352,"output_tokens":729,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":956,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":729,"cache_read_input_tokens":475352,"cache_creation_input_tokens":956,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":956},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqUDFFbB931Zsui6N9A5","type":"assistant","uuid":"68e36233-e816-4aa9-9dbe-865848f3ab44","timestamp":"2026-08-08T14:52:05.868Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
