{"parentUuid":"091cf53c-9593-4e98-86ce-1614d7c4ccd8","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b85f192b-6e12-4bae-ac60-54c916d5ed0c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Give a benchmark status update: rep50 4-arm cell (baseline/eg/cmm/graphify) pair counts and token results per arm, plus Gemini 300 and any remaining rep30 cells. Flag any wt fails, cmm/graphify SKIPs, or arm-asymmetric problems. Keep it short — a table and anything that changed."},"isMeta":true,"uuid":"f5da7296-b7c8-40e1-aa96-d09f4a8efecd","timestamp":"2026-08-08T14:52:06.008Z","permissionMode":"auto","promptSource":"system","queuePriority":"later","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"f5da7296-b7c8-40e1-aa96-d09f4a8efecd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqUET3nQW9s6QCF4GY3o","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015fvLaFiwFARzJqkwty63Rg","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/graphmark-bench && git add agentic-swebench/tools/eg-q agentic-swebench/tools/run_3arm.sh && git commit -q -F - <<'MSG'\nzero-toll: stop the pre-delivered payload being re-derived at full price\n\nEG_PREFETCH=1 has always injected the search payload into turn 0 AND left the\nagent free to re-derive it. eg-q's search branch ran a live query -- ~5s and an\nindex build -- returning bytes the prompt already contained. That is why every\nprefetch attempt measured null: the payload was delivered twice and paid for\nonce at full price.\n\nEG_PRESEARCH now points the tool at the injected payload, so a residual search\ncosts one message and nothing more.\n\nTwo independent measurement bases say the call itself is the cost:\n  internal/cli/search.go:254 (n=178 gated pairs) -- one graph call prices at\n  1.61 messages, not 1; a regression holding call count fixed still charges\n  +7.0% CI[1.9,13.2] for merely having made it; calls that displaced no grep\n  (n=43) cost 1.165 CI[1.073,1.264] and ran +1.21 turns against 0.938\n  CI[0.889,0.990] and -2.07 turns for calls that did.\n  run_3arm.sh:482 (n=30, 3 replicates) -- the turn delta decomposes as\n  +1.00 graph call - 0.89 greps saved + 0.33 induced reads.\n\nNothing predicts which call will be the no-op (best AUC 0.553 at a 28% base\nrate), so selective skipping is not implementable and delivery has to be\nuniversal -- hence an echo rather than a smarter trigger.\n\neg-q cats the payload and skips _pp: prefetch.payload is already eg-q output,\nso re-running the chain would post-process it twice, and _strip_*/_untrust/\n_anchor are not idempotent. Byte-identity with the prompt block is the point --\nan echo that differed would re-open the phase the pre-delivery closed.\n\nScope verified by block matching, not assumed: the export sits at line 704,\ninside `if [ \"$arm\" = eg ]` (446-939) and inside the EG_PREFETCH gate (498), so\nit cannot reach the baseline arm and is inert unless prefetch is on.\n\nOffline gate, $0: echo byte-identical to the prompt payload; 0.02s against 5.21s\nfor a live search; missing payload errors rather than silently re-querying; real\nsearch unaffected when unset; def/callers/impact/grep unaffected.\nMSG\ngit log --oneline -1\nP=graph-benchmarks-504800\nperl -e 'alarm shift; exec @ARGV' 300 gcloud compute ssh graphbench-c --project=$P --zone=us-east1-b --tunnel-through-iap --quiet --command='cd ~/work/graphmark/agentic-swebench\npython3 ~/sc50.py 2>/dev/null | head -4\necho \"live=$(ps -A -o command=|grep -c \"[c]laude -p\")\"\necho \"FLAGS wt=$(find logs -name \"sv50_*.log\" 2>/dev/null|xargs grep -l \"wt fail\" 2>/dev/null|wc -l) cmmskip=$(find logs -name \"sv50_cmm_*.log\" 2>/dev/null|xargs grep -l SKIP 2>/dev/null|wc -l) gfyskip=$(find logs -name \"sv50_graphify_*.log\" 2>/dev/null|xargs grep -l SKIP 2>/dev/null|wc -l) TO50=$(grep -rl \"error_max_turns\" results/REP50_r1_*/*/*/cc_out.json 2>/dev/null|wc -l)\"' 2>&1 | grep -vE 'NumPy|tcp-forward|WARNING|Warning'","description":"Commit zero-toll and refresh status","timeout":500000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":848,"cache_read_input_tokens":476308,"output_tokens":1415,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":848,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1415,"cache_read_input_tokens":476308,"cache_creation_input_tokens":848,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":848},"type":"message"}],"speed":"s