{"parentUuid":"e90cfa6f-30b9-42e1-bc4e-c3b075ad160a","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqUGFL8xqzAJHgwZbcQw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Status**\n\n| cell | arm | n | TOKEN | CI | median | wins |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| rep50 4-arm | eg | 49/49 | +1.35% | [−16.9, +18.1] | −4.2% | 24/49 |\n| | cmm | 49/49 | −5.95% | [−28.2, +13.3] | −2.9% | 22/49 |\n| | graphify | 48/49 | −0.50% | [−16.4, +13.9] | −8.1% | 18/48 |\n| G2 (rider) | eg vs base | 10 | −12.19% | — | −14.45% | 3/10 |\n| G3 (displacement) | eg vs base | 11 | −1.24% | — | −0.40% | 5/11 |\n| Gemini 300 | — | 207 | −8.78% | — | — | VM A terminated |\n| rep30 | — | — | — | — | — | VM B terminated, 52 unfinished |\n\n**Flags:** wt 0 · cmm SKIP 0 · graphify SKIP 0 · max-turns 1 · none arm-asymmetric. Open: `carbon-2981` 371 KB baseline patch, `EMPTY PAYLOAD` detector bug.\n\n**Changed:** R-A shipped as `b669a57b` (zero-toll delivery). 0 sessions live on C; no cell numbers moved.\n\nThe defect it fixes explains every prior null prefetch result: `EG_PREFETCH=1` injected the payload into turn 0 **and** let the agent's residual `search` re-derive it at full price — ~5s and an index build, returning bytes the prompt already held. Delivered twice, paid for once at full price. `EG_PRESEARCH` makes the residual call an echo: **0.02s vs 5.21s**, byte-identical to the prompt block.\n\nScope proven by block-matching rather than assumed — the export is at line 704, inside `arm = eg` (446–939) and inside the `EG_PREFETCH` gate (498), so it cannot reach the baseline and is inert unless prefetch is on.\n\nReady to run as a cell whenever you want it; it's the largest fair, adoption-independent lever left (+7% to +9.5% from two independent bases), though the total across all routes is still ~+17%, not 35%."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1699,"cache_r