{"parentUuid":"6cbcb376-d20c-40f1-9100-3f0fe1cc619c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqUeQi4U8gq7RfpEXFrG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Status**\n\n| cell | arm | n | TOKEN | CI | median | wins |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| rep50 4-arm | eg | 49/49 | +1.35% | [−16.9, +18.1] | −4.2% | 24/49 |\n| | cmm | 49/49 | −5.95% | [−28.2, +13.3] | −2.9% | 22/49 |\n| | graphify | 48/49 | −0.50% | [−16.4, +13.9] | −8.1% | 18/48 |\n| G2 (rider) | eg vs base | 10 | −12.19% | — | −14.45% | 3/10 |\n| G3 (displacement) | eg vs base | 11 | −1.24% | — | −0.40% | 5/11 |\n| Gemini 300 | — | 207 | −8.78% | — | — | VM A terminated |\n| rep30 | — | — | — | — | — | VM B terminated, 52 unfinished |\n\n**Flags:** wt 0 · cmm SKIP 0 · graphify SKIP 0 · max-turns 1 · none arm-asymmetric. Open: `carbon-2981` 371 KB patch, `EMPTY PAYLOAD` detector bug.\n\n**Changed — I found a defect in my own classifier and it makes the picture worse, not better.**\n\nI bucketed Bash calls by first word, so `wc -l foo.rb && cat foo.rb` and `gem list | grep -E ...` landed in \"other bash\" instead of exploration. **397 of 586** eg \"other\" calls and **351 of 554** baseline ones actually contain an exploration command.\n\nCorrected:\n\n| | first-word | **anywhere (correct)** |\n|---|---|---|\n| baseline exploration | 855 | **1,206** |\n| eg exploration | 783 | **1,180** |\n| eliminated | 72 (8.4%) | **26 (2.2%)** |\n| per graph call | 1.10 | **0.61** |\n| net messages | +9 | **−37** |\n\nSo the graph **costs 37 more messages than it removes**, and the +1.35% headline comes from somewhere other than displacement — most likely the cheaper-per-turn effect the prefetch note measured (−3.2% tokens/turn).\n\nTwo consequences: the exploration pool is 41% larger than I reported, and 35% now needs each call to eliminate **6.9 → still 6.9**, but from a starting point of 0.61 rather than 1.10 — an 11× move, not 6.3×.\n\nIt also strengthens R-A: if the call's net contribution is *negative*, removing the call is worth more than I priced. Correcting the plan file now."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3759,"cache_read_input_tokens":479751,"output_tokens":892,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3759,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":892,"cache_read_input_tokens":479751,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3759,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3759},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqUeJSn39NRnfBFdKRpk","type":"assistant","uuid":"ee86ccf4-4ca3-4be2-8880-020b49dd89db","timestamp":"2026-08-08T14:57:45.551Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
