{"parentUuid":"2cf69926-4b48-4b3a-a865-fca1411be7b1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqV65hY9YUT8eYzxZwte","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Twelfth payload metric, and it dies the same way as the previous eleven:\n\n| group | n | whole-file reads eliminated | **TOKEN** |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| all | 49 | +11.8% | +1.35% |\n| payload has complete-symbols | 33 | +13.7% | +0.76% |\n| **3+ complete-symbols** | 26 | **+16.1%** | **−4.28%** |\n\n`corr(complete-symbol count, whole-file-read elimination) = +0.154` — but `corr(complete-symbol count, token saving) = **−0.170**`. More complete symbols suppress whole-file reads slightly *and cost more tokens*. The contrast group is also empty (all 33 logged payloads carry at least one), so the test is weak in the direction of *over*-crediting it.\n\nRecording it and correcting the plan with the hour's findings:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4010,"cache_read_input_tokens":494049,"output_tokens":2762,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4010,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2762,"cache_read_input_tokens":494049,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4010,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4010},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqV5vxvPbYNxW7LaHMMR","type":"assistant","uuid":"89c33d15-4e9d-4333-91e3-dc9f4cd621bf","timestamp":"2026-08-08T15:03:40.143Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"89c33d15-4e9d-4333-91e3-dc9f4cd621bf","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqV65hY9YUT8eYzxZwte","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Mc36xrFsf7n4h1zunpaqRd","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\np='EG-ROUTE-TO-35.md'; s=open(p).read()\nins = \"\"\"\n---\n\n## 2A. CORRECTION — the classifier undercounted, and the saving is not a message saving\n\nTwo defects in my own measurement, found by re-checking rather than by a new cell.\n\n**2A.1 — Bucketing Bash calls by their FIRST WORD undercounts exploration by 41%.**\n`wc -l foo.rb && cat foo.rb` and `gem list | grep -E ...` were filed as \"other bash\".\n**397 of 586** eg \"other\" calls and **351 of 554** baseline ones contain an exploration command.\n\n| | first-word | **corrected** |\n|---|---|---|\n| baseline exploration | 855 | **1,206** |\n| eg exploration | 783 | **1,180** |\n| eliminated | 72 (8.4%) | **26 (2.2%)** |\n| eliminations per graph call | 1.10 | **0.61** |\n| net messages | **+9** | **−37** |\n\n**The graph costs 37 more messages than it removes.** eg spends **+38 turns** and still lands\n+1.35%, so the saving cannot be a message saving at all.\n\n**2A.2 — The saving is context density, not message count.**\n\n    tokens +1.35%  =  turns −1.42%  +  tokens/turn +2.74%\n\neg's turns are 2.7% cheaper. That reproduces the independent prefetch measurement at\n`run_3arm.sh:482` (30,302 → 29,334 tok/turn, −3.2%) almost exactly. **cache_read is 95.5% of all\ntokens; output is 1.5%** — this is a context-size problem.\n\nVariance decomposition of the paired log token ratio: turns **34.2%**, tokens/turn **26.0%**,\ncovariance **39.8%** (they are entangled, corr +0.668). Neither side dominates alone.\n\n**2A.3 — Where context cost actually sits.** A tool result injected at turn *i* is re-charged on\nevery turn after it. Weighting each result by (bytes ÷ 4) × turns-remaining:\n\n| class | baseline calls | persist-cost | share | per call | eg captures |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| exploration | 1,206 | 17.4M | **45.1%** | 14k | **1.1%** |\n| **whole-file `Read`** | **119** | **11.7M** | **30.3%** | **98k (7× worse)** | **21%** |\n| harness | 576 | 4.3M | 11.2% | 7k | 14% |\n| range `Read` | 121 | 3.6M | 9.3% | 30k | −22% |\n| graph calls | 0 | 0 | — | 18k | −1.7M |\n\n**Totals: eg 38.5M vs baseline 38.6M — +0.2%.** The tool is context-neutral overall. Its one\nstrong category is whole-file reads (30.3% of all context cost from only 2.4 calls per session),\nwhere it already removes 21% of the cost.\n\n**2A.4 — But complete-symbol payloads do not convert. TWELFTH dead payload metric.**\n\n| group | n | whole-file reads eliminated | TOKEN |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| all | 49 | +11.8% | +1.35% |\n| payload carries complete-symbols | 33 | +13.7% | +0.76% |\n| 3+ complete-symbols | 26 | **+16.1%** | **−4.28%** |\n\n`corr(complete-symbols, whole-file elimination) = +0.154`;\n`corr(complete-symbols, token saving) = **−0.170**`. More complete symbols suppress whole-file\nreads slightly *and cost more*. Add to §6.\n\n\"\"\"\ns = s.replace(\"\\n---\\n\\n## 3. The ceiling of loser repair\", ins + \"\\n---\\n\\n## 3. The ceiling of loser repair\")\ns = s.replace(\"| R-A zero-toll delivery | +151 | 5.7% | +7.0% to +9.5% |\",\n              \"| R-A zero-toll delivery | +94 to +151 | 3.5–5.7% | **+4.8% to +6.9%** (computed directly, §2A.2) |\")\ns = s.replace(\"11. Any new verb in the affordance tail — 0/66 across three attempts.\",\n              \"11. Any new verb in the affordance tail — 0/66 across three attempts.\\n12. **Complete-symbol payload density** — corr with token saving **−0.170**; the 3+ group\\n    measures −4.28% against +1.35% overall (§2A.4).\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nprint(\"plan updated:\", \"TWELFTH dead payload metric\" in s, \"| 0.61 |\" in s or \"**0.61**\" in s)\nPY\ngrep -c \"\" EG-ROUTE-TO-35.md","description":"Add corrections to plan"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4010,"cache_read_input_tokens":494049,"output_tokens":2762,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4010,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2762,"cache_read_input_tokens":494049,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4010,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4010},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqV5vxvPbYNxW7LaHMMR","type":"assistant","uuid":"6dfee548-a4de-472c-93d2-4585d3b6c39e","timestamp":"2026-08-08T15:03:59.992Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
