{"parentUuid":"0b0892a1-3cc3-4153-915c-3837a151d298","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqVC1UxFeFDML2f7RU3z","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3366,"cache_read_input_tokens":500820,"output_tokens":2110,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3366,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":2110,"cache_read_input_tokens":500820,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3366,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3366},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqVBvSauUyvTmE8AfyDP","type":"assistant","uuid":"6b840802-61bc-4694-9d6b-be1b921c9718","timestamp":"2026-08-08T15:05:03.420Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"6b840802-61bc-4694-9d6b-be1b921c9718","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqVC1UxFeFDML2f7RU3z","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"That kills the R-B reframing too, and identifies what the tool is actually doing.\n\n**Exploration calls are already cheap: median 732 B**, p90 3.6 KB, only 1.3% over 8 KB. The graph's own output has a **median of 1,124 B — larger than a median grep.** A graph-backed grep would *add* bytes. R-B is dead on both metrics, not just the one I tested.\n\nExploration's 47% share comes from *volume* (1,206 calls), not size. The concentrated cost is elsewhere:\n\n| | baseline | eg |\n|---|---|---|\n| whole-file reads | 119 | **105** |\n| median size | 5,125 B | **4,081 B** |\n| calls >8 KB | 39 (32.8%) | **25 (23.8%)** |\n| share of whole-file bytes in those | 70.9% | **60.4%** |\n| range reads | 121 | **133** |\n\n**This is the tool's real mechanism, and it's the one place it works:** eg converts whole-file reads into range reads — 14 fewer whole-file, 12 more ranged, median size down 20%, and the expensive >8 KB tail cut from 39 calls to 25. That's the 21% capture of the single most concentrated context category, and it is essentially the entire +1.35%.\n\nIt also bounds the remaining upside: pushing whole-file 105 → 40 (converting to ranges) is worth ≈ **−3.6M of 38.5M = +9.4%**. With R-A's +4.8–6.9% that's **+14–16%** — the sixth independent derivation landing in the same band.\n\nTwo levers survive the hour, both fair, neither reaching 35%:\n\n| lever | status | worth |\n|---|---|---|\n| **R-A** zero-toll delivery | **built, offline-gated, committed `b669a57b`** | +4.8% to +6.9% |\n| **R-D** whole-file → range conversion | mechanism identified, not built | ≈ +9% |\n\nDead this hour: R-B (twice), complete-symbol density (12th payload metric), and my own two measurement defects. Plan updated at `devenv/EG-ROUTE-TO-35.md`."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3366,"cache_read_input_tokens":500820,"output_tokens":2110,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3366,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":2110,"cache_read_input_tokens":500820,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3366,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3366},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqVBvSauUyvTmE8AfyDP","type":"assistant","uuid":"e84cc8d3-e3c2-460b-98a2-062de6564fdd","timestamp":"2026-08-08T15:05:12.855Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
