{"parentUuid":"bded6696-f4dd-48e7-ab28-1c42342d998d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqVe3GL5E5Qa6c5pw7Ex","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Status**\n\n| cell | arm | n | TOKEN | CI | median | wins |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| rep50 4-arm | eg | 49/49 | +1.35% | [−16.9, +18.1] | −4.2% | 24/49 |\n| | cmm | 49/49 | −5.95% | [−28.2, +13.3] | −2.9% | 22/49 |\n| | graphify | 48/49 | −0.50% | [−16.4, +13.9] | −8.1% | 18/48 |\n| G2 (rider) | eg vs base | 10 | −12.19% | — | −14.45% | 3/10 |\n| G3 (displacement) | eg vs base | 11 | −1.24% | — | −0.40% | 5/11 |\n| Gemini 300 | — | 207 | −8.78% | — | — | VM A terminated |\n| rep30 | — | — | — | — | — | VM B terminated, 52 unfinished |\n\n**Flags:** wt 0 · cmm SKIP 0 · graphify SKIP 0 · max-turns 1 · none arm-asymmetric. Open: `carbon-2981` 371 KB patch, `EMPTY PAYLOAD` detector bug.\n\n**Changed — R-D diagnosed, and it splits three ways rather than being one fixable thing.** Why the eg arm still opens 105 whole files:\n\n| cause | calls | persist-cost | share |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **c) file was in the payload *with its body*** | 24 | 3.90M | **42.3%** |\n| no payload logged (detector bug) | 36 | 3.32M | 36.0% |\n| **a) file never in the payload** | 42 | 1.95M | 21.1% |\n| b) in payload as locator only | 3 | 0.05M | 0.5% |\n\n**The largest slice is the agent re-reading a whole file the payload already gave it in full** — 42.3% of the remaining cost. That is not a retrieval gap or a completeness gap; it's the payload being ignored, and it's the same wall as the 0/66 verb adoption. No tool change fixes it.\n\nThe 21.1% \"never in payload\" slice is a genuine retrieval gap, but the misses are `test_linear.py`, `fcall.json`, `isAbsoluteURL.js` — test fixtures and data files, which the payload deliberately demotes.\n\nSo R-D's addressable share is ~21% of 9.2M ≈ 1.9M of 38.5M context ≈ **+5%**, not the +9% I estimated an hour ago — and it requires *un*-demoting test files, which was itself a measured win. I'd not build it on that basis.\n\n**Also flagged:** the `EMPTY PAYLOAD` detector bug now has a second cost — 36 of 105 whole-file reads (36% of the cost) can't be classified because the payload wasn't logged. Fixing it is a prerequisite for any further payload forensics."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2586,"cache_read_input_tokens":508138,"output_tokens":991,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2586,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":991,"cache_read_input_tokens":508138,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2586,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2586},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqVdt3wvEXcK6AtoX1LH","type":"assistant","uuid":"f1f42056-1a10-45c5-bde2-cebb47333307","timestamp":"2026-08-08T15:10:50.878Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
