{"parentUuid":"8d58a428-169b-4624-a813-bc6bf561efb1","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"hook_success","hookName":"PreToolUse:Bash","toolUseID":"toolu_018EYwsji3SrAk5bqakGbb8J","hookEvent":"PreToolUse","content":"","stdout":"{\"hookSpecificOutput\":{\"hookEventName\":\"PreToolUse\",\"permissionDecisionReason\":\"RTK auto-rewrite\",\"updatedInput\":{\"command\":\"rtk ls -la /Users/suhaan/devenv/EG-FINAL-PLAN.md && echo \\\"---\\\" && rtk read /Users/suhaan/devenv/EG-FINAL-PLAN.md --max-lines 30 && echo \\\"...\\\" && rtk grep -n \\\"^## \\\" /Users/suhaan/devenv/EG-FINAL-PLAN.md\",\"description\":\"Confirm plan file exists\"}}}\n","stderr":"","exitCode":0,"command":"rtk hook claude","durationMs":19},"type":"attachment","uuid":"f8cb9d0d-96be-4a04-8700-256166ef8253","timestamp":"2026-08-08T15:30:31.164Z","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"8d58a428-169b-4624-a813-bc6bf561efb1","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"64d29f49-1890-4814-8987-a47e62b77470","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018EYwsji3SrAk5bqakGbb8J","type":"tool_result","content":"644  /Users/suhaan/devenv/EG-FINAL-PLAN.md  11.6K\n---\n# entire-graph — the finalized plan\n\n**2026-08-08.** Supersedes `PLAN-TO-35PCT.md` and `EG-ROUTE-TO-35.md`. Everything below is\nmeasured on rep50 (49 gated pairs, Opus, SWE-bench Multilingual) unless marked projection.\nSign convention: **positive = the graph arm saved tokens.**\n\n---\n\n## 1. The metric is context, not messages\n\n    tokens +1.35%  =  turns −1.42%  +  tokens/turn +2.74%\n\nThe eg arm spends **38 more turns** and still wins, so the saving is not a message saving.\n**cache_read is 95.5% of all tokens** (cache_creation 3.0%, output 1.5%). This is a context-size\nproblem. The independent prefetch measurement at `run_3arm.sh:482` found the same thing on a\n[210 more lines]...\n9:## 1. The metric is context, not messages\n26:## 2. The complete budget\n62:## 3. Why the uncaptured cost is uncaptured — the decisive split\n93:## 4. The ceiling, computed from the budget\n134:## 5. What to do, in order\n177:## 6. Struck — measured, do not re-propose\n210:## 7. Corrections issued this session","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"cd53770a-a36c-4647-b1c2-54b82dad3ee8","timestamp":"2026-08-08T15:30:33.942Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"644  /Users/suhaan/devenv/EG-FINAL-PLAN.md  11.6K\n---\n# entire-graph — the finalized plan\n\n**2026-08-08.** Supersedes `PLAN-TO-35PCT.md` and `EG-ROUTE-TO-35.md`. Everything below is\nmeasured on rep50 (49 gated pairs, Opus, SWE-bench Multilingual) unless marked projection.\nSign convention: **positive = the graph arm saved tokens.**\n\n---\n\n## 1. The metric is context, not messages\n\n    tokens +1.35%  =  turns −1.42%  +  tokens/turn +2.74%\n\nThe eg arm spends **38 more turns** and still wins, so the saving is not a message saving.\n**cache_read is 95.5% of all tokens** (cache_creation 3.0%, output 1.5%). This is a context-size\nproblem. The independent prefetch measurement at `run_3arm.sh:482` found the same thing on a\n[210 more lines]...\n9:## 1. The metric is context, not messages\n26:## 2. The complete budget\n62:## 3. Why the uncaptured cost is uncaptured — the decisive split\n93:## 4. The ceiling, computed from the budget\n134:## 5. What to do, in order\n177:## 6. Struck — measured, do not re-propose\n210:## 7. Corrections issued this session","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8d58a428-169b-4624-a813-bc6bf561efb1","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"cd53770a-a36c-4647-b1c2-54b82dad3ee8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqXAdVaF6SbhRZcpN8cC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01MSwAyN2KjLEoZaCnEzWm7K","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"P=graph-benchmarks-504800\ncat > /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-suhaan-devenv/73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49/scratchpad/val.py <<'PY'\n# VALIDATE the persist-token model PER INSTANCE. The plan's whole section 4 rests on a\n# calibration factor derived from ONE aggregate ratio. If it is not stable per instance,\n# every projection built on it is unreliable.\nimport json,glob,os,re,math,collections\nIDX={os.path.basename(f)[:-6]:f for f in glob.glob(os.path.expanduser(\"~/.claude/projects/*/*.jsonl\"))}\ndef persist(tag,arm):\n    out={}\n    for cj in glob.glob(f\"results/{tag}/{arm}/*/cc_out.json\"):\n        iid=os.path.basename(os.path.dirname(cj))\n        try: j=json.load(open(cj))\n        except: continue\n        if j.get(\"subtype\")!=\"success\": continue\n        p=os.path.join(os.path.dirname(cj),\"patch.diff\")\n        if not(os.path.exists(p) and os.path.getsize(p)>0): continue\n        tf=IDX.get(j.get(\"session_id\"))\n        if not tf: continue\n        calls=[];res={}\n        for line in open(tf,errors=\"ignore\"):\n            try: m=json.loads(line)\n            except: continue\n            msg=m.get(\"message\") or {}\n            if msg.get(\"role\")==\"assistant\":\n                for b in (msg.get(\"content\") or []):\n                    if isinstance(b,dict) and b.get(\"type\")==\"tool_use\": calls.append(b.get(\"id\"))\n            elif msg.get(\"role\")==\"user\":\n                for b in (msg.get(\"content\") or []):\n                    if isinstance(b,dict) and b.get(\"type\")==\"tool_result\":\n                        t=b.get(\"content\")\n                        if isinstance(t,list): t=\" \".join(x.get(\"text\",\"\") for x in t if isinstance(x,dict))\n                        res[b.get(\"tool_use_id\")]=len(t or \"\")\n        N=len(calls); tot=0.0\n        for i,cid in enumerate(calls): tot += res.get(cid,0)/4.0*(N-i)\n        u=j.get(\"usage\",{})\n        out[iid]=(tot,sum(u.get(k,0) for k in (\"input_tokens\",\"output_tokens\",\"cache_read_input_tokens\",\"cache_creation_input_tokens\")))\n    return out\nE=persist(\"REP50_r1_eg\",\"eg\"); B=persist(\"REP50_r1_baseline\",\"baseline\")\nks=sorted(set(E)&set(B))\nX=[];Y=[]\nfor k in ks:\n    if B[k][0]<=0 or E[k][0]<=0: continue\n    X.append(math.log(E[k][0]/B[k][0]))   # model-predicted context delta\n    Y.append(math.log(E[k][1]/B[k][1]))   # actual token delta\nn=len(X); mx=sum(X)/n; my=sum(Y)/n\nsx=math.sqrt(sum((a-mx)**2 for a in X)/n); sy=math.sqrt(sum((b-my)**2 for b in Y)/n)\nr=sum((a-mx)*(b-my) for a,b in zip(X,Y))/(n*sx*sy)\nslope=sum((a-mx)*(b-my) for a,b in zip(X,Y))/sum((a-mx)**2 for a in X)\nprint(f\"PER-INSTANCE VALIDATION of the persist model   n={n}\")\nprint(f\"  corr(model delta, actual token delta) = {r:+.3f}\")\nprint(f\"  slope                                 = {slope:.3f}   (1.0 = perfectly calibrated)\")\nprint(f\"  R^2                                   = {r*r:.3f}\")\n# aggregate check\npe=sum(E[k][0] for k in ks); pb=sum(B[k][0] for k in ks)\nte=sum(E[k][1] for k in ks); tb=sum(B[k][1] for k in ks)\nprint(f\"\\n  AGGREGATE model {(1-pe/pb)*100:+.2f}%   actual {(1-te/tb)*100:+.2f}%   ratio {((1-te/tb))/max((1-pe/pb),1e-9):.2f}\")\n# does the model at least rank instances correctly?\npairs=sorted(zip(X,Y))\ntop=[y for x,y in pairs[:12]]; bot=[y for x,y in pairs[-12:]]\nprint(f\"  12 instances the model says are BEST : mean actual {sum(bot)/len(bot)*100:+.1f}% log-delta\")\nprint(f\"  12 instances the model says are WORST: mean actual {sum(top)/len(top)*100:+.1f}% log-delta\")\nPY\nperl -e 'alarm shift; exec @ARGV' 600 gcloud compute ssh graphbench-c --project=$P --zone=us-east1-b --tunnel-through-iap --quiet --command=\"cd ~/work/graphmark/agentic-swebench && cat > /tmp/val.py <<'EOF'\n$(cat /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-suhaan-devenv/73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49/scratchpad/val.py)\nEOF\npython3 /tmp/val.py\" 2>&1 | grep -vE 'NumPy|tcp-forward|WARNING|Warning'","description":"Validate persist model per instance","timeout":700000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1080,"cache_read_input_tokens":541165,"output_tokens":1974,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1080,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1974,"cache_read_input_tokens":541165,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1080,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1080},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqXAV2pzYMhH7wA2Yt8P","type":"assistant","uuid":"8935f8ee-db1f-4856-bf5b-c8c69a5458b1","timestamp":"2026-08-08T15:30:57.074Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"8935f8ee-db1f-4856-bf5b-c8c69a5458b1","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"64d29f49-1890-4814-8987-a47e62b77470","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MSwAyN2KjLEoZaCnEzWm7K","type":"tool_result","content":"PER-INSTANCE VALIDATION of the persist model   n=49\n  corr(model delta, actual token delta) = +0.916\n  slope                                 = 0.822   (1.0 = perfectly calibrated)\n  R^2                                   = 0.839\n\n  AGGREGATE model +0.18%   actual +1.35%   ratio 7.33\n  12 instances the model says are BEST : mean actual +56.5% log-delta\n  12 instances the model says are WORST: mean actual -58.9% log-delta","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"cb854787-7639-49ed-9f1b-4ac7868ecfe9","timestamp":"2026-08-08T15:31:01.361Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"PER-INSTANCE VALIDATION of the persist model   n=49\n  corr(model delta, actual token delta) = +0.916\n  slope                                 = 0.822   (1.0 = perfectly calibrated)\n  R^2                                   = 0.839\n\n  AGGREGATE model +0.18%   actual +1.35%   ratio 7.33\n  12 instances the model says are BEST : mean actual +56.5% log-delta\n  12 instances the model says are WORST: mean actual -58.9% log-delta","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8935f8ee-db1f-4856-bf5b-c8c69a5458b1","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"cb854787-7639-49ed-9f1b-4ac7868ecfe9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqXCjotHvVGVHGvvSZ83","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2149,"cache_read_input_tokens":542245,"output_tokens":3200,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2149,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3200,"cache_read_input_tokens":542245,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2149,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2149},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqXCWrmY6kEwNbvFhhN8","type":"assistant","uuid":"6f322758-63c9-455a-96a0-e56c9ccd2ffb","timestamp":"2026-08-08T15:31:18.358Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"6f322758-63c9-455a-96a0-e56c9ccd2ffb","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqXCjotHvVGVHGvvSZ83","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The verification just overturned my own calibration. Validating the persist model **per instance** rather than on one aggregate ratio:\n\n| test | result |\n|---|---|\n| corr(model delta, actual token delta) | **+0.916** |\n| slope | **0.822** |\n| R² | **0.839** |\n| aggregate ratio (all tool results) | **7.33** |\n| aggregate ratio (classified categories only) | 0.54 |\n\nThe model is **excellent per instance** (R² = 0.84, n=49) but its *aggregate* ratio swings from 0.54 to 7.33 depending on which denominator you use — so the ×0.54 I applied an hour ago was an artifact of one arbitrary aggregation, not a calibration. The defensible factor is the **regression slope, 0.822**. Correcting the plan:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2149,"cache_read_input_tokens":542245,"output_tokens":3200,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2149,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3200,"cache_read_input_tokens":542245,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2149,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2149},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqXCWrmY6kEwNbvFhhN8","type":"assistant","uuid":"60a8d69e-3909-4d4f-9525-ea2f1622958c","timestamp":"2026-08-08T15:31:21.155Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"60a8d69e-3909-4d4f-9525-ea2f1622958c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqXCjotHvVGVHGvvSZ83","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01YVEVdoHBwdCBo6AsYwFYbM","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\np='EG-FINAL-PLAN.md'; s=open(p).read()\ns = s.replace(\n\"\"\"**CALIBRATION — the model over-predicts by ~1.9×.** Measured headline is **+1.35%**, so\npersist-tokens are not proportional to billed tokens: the unit ignores prompt, system and\nthinking tokens, and it charges each injection once against remaining turns rather than charging\nthe whole context on every turn. **Multiply every projection derived from this model by 0.54.**\nFailing to do so is how the +2.51% above would have become a false claim of reconciliation.\"\"\",\n\"\"\"**CALIBRATION — validated per instance, n=49.** Regressing each instance's model-predicted\ncontext delta on its actual token delta:\n\n| test | result |\n|---|---|\n| corr(model delta, actual token delta) | **+0.916** |\n| **slope** | **0.822** |\n| R² | **0.839** |\n\nThe model tracks per-instance outcomes closely, and it *ranks* correctly: the 12 instances it\ncalls best average **+56.5%** actual log-delta, the 12 it calls worst **−58.9%**.\n\n**Use the slope (0.822) as the calibration — never an aggregate ratio.** The aggregate ratio is\nunstable by construction: summing only the classified categories gives 0.54, summing every tool\nresult gives 7.33, because the two use different denominators. An earlier draft of this plan\napplied 0.54 and understated every projection by ~35%; that was an artifact of one arbitrary\naggregation, not a property of the model.\"\"\")\n\ns = s.replace(\n\"\"\"| | persist-tokens | raw % of 38.6M | **calibrated ×0.54** |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| graph-addressable pool | 24.1M | 62.4% | 33.7% |\n| …of which coverage-fixable | 7.53M | 19.5% | **10.5%** |\n| …of which ignored-payload (needs an instruction) | 5.18M | 13.4% | 7.2% |\n| …of which already captured | 3.77M | 9.8% | 5.3% |\n| payload cost to widen coverage (projection) | −2 to −3M | −5 to −8% | −3 to −4% |\n\n**Coverage work, delivered perfectly and priced honestly: ≈ +7%** (13.0% raw × 0.54).\n**R-A (remove the call toll): +4.8% to +6.9%** — computed directly from turns × tokens/turn, so\nit needs **no** calibration.\n**Together: +12% to +14%.**\n\nNote the calibrated addressable pool is **33.7%** — so even capturing *the entire* graph-\naddressable surface at zero payload cost would land at roughly 34%, and 13.4% raw / 7.2%\ncalibrated of it is ignored-payload that no tool change reaches.\"\"\",\n\"\"\"| | persist-tokens | raw % of 38.6M | **calibrated ×0.822** |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| graph-addressable pool | 24.1M | 62.4% | **51.3%** |\n| …of which coverage-fixable | 7.53M | 19.5% | **16.0%** |\n| …of which ignored-payload (needs an instruction) | 5.18M | 13.4% | 11.0% |\n| …of which already captured | 3.77M | 9.8% | 8.0% |\n| payload cost to widen coverage (projection) | −2 to −3M | −5 to −8% | −4 to −6% |\n\n**Coverage work, delivered perfectly and priced honestly: ≈ +10.7%** (13.0% net raw × 0.822).\n**R-A (remove the call toll): +4.8% to +6.9%** — computed directly from turns × tokens/turn, so\nit needs **no** calibration.\n**Together: +15.5% to +17.6%.**\n\nThe calibrated addressable pool is **51.3%**, so 35% is not excluded by the size of the pool —\nit is excluded by what sits inside it. **11.0% of the 51.3% is ignored-payload**: the agent\nre-reading or re-grepping something it was already handed in full. No tool change reaches that,\nand the only thing that would — an instruction to re-read less — helps a no-tool arm equally.\"\"\")\n\ns = s.replace(\"| coverage + R-A, from the calibrated context budget | **+12% to +14%** |\",\n              \"| coverage + R-A, calibrated context budget (slope 0.822) | **+15.5% to +17.6%** |\")\ns = s.replace(\"> **35% is not reachable on a fair measurement. The honest number is +12% to +21%**, and the\\n> two estimates built from this session's context budget sit at the bottom of that range.\",\n              \"> **35% is not reachable on a fair measurement. The honest number is +15% to +21%**, and the\\n> estimate built from this session's calibrated context budget (+15.5% to +17.6%) sits squarely\\n> on the best fair cell ever measured (+17.21%, n=26).\")\ns = s.replace(\"Expected value after calibration: **≈ +7%**, not the +12% the raw model suggests.\",\n              \"Expected value after calibration (slope 0.822): **≈ +10.7%**.\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nprint(\"recalibrated:\", \"×0.822\" in s, \"+15.5% to +17.6%\" in s, \"0.54\" not in s.split(\"An earlier draft\")[1][:200])\nPY\npython3 -c \"\nraw=(7.53-2.5)/38.6*100\nprint(f'coverage net raw {raw:.1f}%  x0.822 = {raw*0.822:.1f}%')\nprint(f'+ R-A 4.8-6.9%  =>  {raw*0.822+4.8:.1f}% to {raw*0.822+6.9:.1f}%')\nprint(f'calibrated addressable ceiling: {24.09/38.6*100*0.822:.1f}%')\nprint(f'ignored-payload (unreachable): {5.18/38.6*100*0.822:.1f}%')\n\"","description":"Recalibrate plan with validated slope"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2149,"cache_read_input_tokens":542245,"output_tokens":3200,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2149,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3200,"cache_read_input_tokens":542245,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2149,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2149},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqXCWrmY6kEwNbvFhhN8","type":"assistant","uuid":"fbbfe53f-837e-4e36-9789-fa2bc588db06","timestamp":"2026-08-08T15:31:42.161Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e8