{"parentUuid":"fbbfe53f-837e-4e36-9789-fa2bc588db06","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"64d29f49-1890-4814-8987-a47e62b77470","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YVEVdoHBwdCBo6AsYwFYbM","type":"tool_result","content":"recalibrated: True True False\ncoverage net raw 13.0%  x0.822 = 10.7%\n+ R-A 4.8-6.9%  =>  15.5% to 17.6%\ncalibrated addressable ceiling: 51.3%\nignored-payload (unreachable): 11.0%","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"cb6a1d23-e75e-418d-b279-66db6f0ca4dd","timestamp":"2026-08-08T15:31:44.320Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"recalibrated: True True False\ncoverage net raw 13.0%  x0.822 = 10.7%\n+ R-A 4.8-6.9%  =>  15.5% to 17.6%\ncalibrated addressable ceiling: 51.3%\nignored-payload (unreachable): 11.0%","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"fbbfe53f-837e-4e36-9789-fa2bc588db06","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"cb6a1d23-e75e-418d-b279-66db6f0ca4dd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqXFmfqU6SPFxoBG4n6m","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The plan file is at **`/Users/suhaan/devenv/EG-FINAL-PLAN.md`** (11.6 KB, 7 sections) — and I'm still verifying it, which just caught a second error in my own work.\n\n**What the verification overturned:** an hour ago I applied a ×0.54 calibration derived from one aggregate ratio. Validating the model *per instance* instead:\n\n| test | result |\n|---|---|\n| corr(model, actual token delta) | **+0.916** |\n| slope | **0.822** |\n| R² | **0.839** |\n| ranks correctly | best-12 average **+56.5%** actual, worst-12 **−58.9%** |\n\nThe model is strong per instance. Its **aggregate** ratio is the unstable thing — 0.54 using classified categories, 7.33 using all tool results, because the denominators differ. So ×0.54 was an artifact, and it had understated every projection by ~35%.\n\n**Corrected with the validated slope (0.822):**\n\n| | was (×0.54) | **now (×0.822)** |\n|---|---|---|\n| addressable pool | 33.7% | **51.3%** |\n| coverage-fixable | 10.5% | **16.0%** |\n| ignored-payload (unreachable) | 7.2% | **11.0%** |\n| coverage work, net of payload cost | +7% | **+10.7%** |\n| **coverage + R-A** | +12–14% | **+15.5% to +17.6%** |\n\nThat now lands squarely on the best fair cell ever measured (+17.21%, n=26), which is a much better consistency check than the number I had.\n\n**And it sharpens why 35% fails.** The pool isn't the constraint — 51.3% of context cost *is* graph-addressable. The constraint is what's inside it: **11.0% is ignored payload**, the agent re-reading or re-grepping something it was already handed in full. No tool change reaches that, and the only thing that would — telling the agent to re-read less — helps a no-tool arm equally, which is exactly the asymmetry that produced the withdrawn −35%.\n\nContinuing to verify the remaining load-bearing claims (the 69.1% coverage split and R-A's +4.8–6.9%)."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3288,"cache_read_input_tokens":544394,"output_tokens":731,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3288,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":731,"cache_read_input_tokens":544394,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3288,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3288},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqXFfiAQNqaz6YY5GgTB","type":"assistant","uuid":"87e864a5-2d0f-45b2-9b84-f36e549d6ae1","timestamp":"2026-08-08T15:31:57.237Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
