{"parentUuid":"66f4ec0e-e7ba-4c60-8e39-d989d621229e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqXdr2tV2AS31W7dcxik","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Q7Dwgq4hDtZHrLaECemiyc","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\np='EG-FINAL-PLAN.md'; s=open(p).read()\ns = s.replace(\n\"\"\"Worth **+4.8% to +6.9%**. Fair without qualification: the eg prompt gains tool output and *loses*\nan instruction. **Next step: run it as a paired cell.**\"\"\",\n\"\"\"**Verified by counterfactual on all 49 pairs** (each session's own tokens/turn held fixed; the\nprocedure reproduces +1.35% exactly at zero removal):\n\n| | point | bootstrap CI |\n|---|---|---|\n| R-A at 1.00 msg/call | **+4.26%** | [−14.44, +21.18] |\n| R-A at 1.61 msg/call | **+6.04%** | [−11.21, +22.20] |\n\n**Worth +4.3% to +6.0%** — corrected down from the +4.8–6.9% an earlier draft carried.\n\n**The CI spans zero, and that is the binding constraint on how to run it.** At n=49 against this\nnoise floor R-A is estimable but not demonstrable in one cell. Do not run a single rep50 and\nreport the number: either raise n to ~120, or run paired replicates of the same config, or gate\non the mechanism count (graph calls per session should fall to ~0) rather than on tokens.\n\nSensitivity is the reassuring part — the mechanism survives its own failure mode. Even if\npre-delivery degrades the payload enough to cost back 40 extra greps suite-wide it still lands\n**+4.74%**:\n\n| greps handed back suite-wide | result |\n|---|---|\n| 0 | +6.04% |\n| 10 | +5.72% |\n| 20 | +5.39% |\n| 40 | +4.74% |\n\nFair without qualification: the eg prompt gains tool output and *loses* an instruction.\"\"\")\ns = s.replace(\"**R-A (remove the call toll): +4.8% to +6.9%** — computed directly from turns × tokens/turn, so\\nit needs **no** calibration.\\n**Together: +15.5% to +17.6%.**\",\n              \"**R-A (remove the call toll): +4.3% to +6.0%** — computed directly from turns × tokens/turn, so\\nit needs **no** calibration. Bootstrap CI spans zero at n=49 (§5.1).\\n**Together: +15.0% to +16.7%.**\")\ns = s.replace(\"| coverage + R-A, calibrated context budget (slope 0.822) | **+15.5% to +17.6%** |\",\n              \"| coverage + R-A, calibrated context budget (slope 0.822) | **+15.0% to +16.7%** |\")\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nprint(\"updated:\", \"+4.26%\" in s, \"+15.0% to +16.7%\" in s)\nPY\nP=graph-benchmarks-504800\nperl -e 'alarm shift; exec @ARGV' 300 gcloud compute ssh graphbench-c --project=$P --zone=us-east1-b --tunnel-through-iap --quiet --command='cd ~/work/graphmark/agentic-swebench\npython3 ~/sc50.py 2>/dev/null | head -4\necho \"live=$(ps -A -o command=|grep -c \"[c]laude -p\") load=$(uptime|sed \"s/.*load average: //\"|cut -d, -f1)\"\necho \"FLAGS wt=$(find logs -name \"sv50_*.log\" 2>/dev/null|xargs grep -l \"wt fail\" 2>/dev/null|wc -l) cmmskip=$(find logs -name \"sv50_cmm_*.log\" 2>/dev/null|xargs grep -l SKIP 2>/dev/null|wc -l) gfyskip=$(find logs -name \"sv50_graphify_*.log\" 2>/dev/null|xargs grep -l SKIP 2>/dev/null|wc -l) TO50=$(grep -rl \"error_max_turns\" results/REP50_r1_*/*/*/cc_out.json 2>/dev/null|wc -l)\"' 2>&1 | grep -vE 'NumPy|tcp-forward|WARNING|Warning'","description":"Update plan with CI and refresh status","timeout":500000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":953,"cache_read_input_tokens":551247,"output_tokens":1513,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":953,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1513,"cache_read_input_tokens":551247,"cache_creation_input_tokens":953,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":953},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requ