{"parentUuid":"f821d136-2ec3-4096-931c-85a455d73f6e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqXfnZLTakAiY9EAXQXL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Status**\n\n| cell | arm | n | TOKEN | CI | median | wins |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| rep50 4-arm | eg | 49/49 | +1.35% | [−16.9, +18.1] | −4.2% | 24/49 |\n| | cmm | 49/49 | −5.95% | [−28.2, +13.3] | −2.9% | 22/49 |\n| | graphify | 48/49 | −0.50% | [−16.4, +13.9] | −8.1% | 18/48 |\n| G2 (rider) | eg vs base | 10 | −12.19% | — | −14.45% | 3/10 |\n| G3 (displacement) | eg vs base | 11 | −1.24% | — | −0.40% | 5/11 |\n| Gemini 300 | — | 207 | −8.78% | — | — | VM A terminated |\n| rep30 | — | — | — | — | — | VM B terminated, 52 unfinished |\n\n**Flags:** wt 0 · cmm SKIP 0 · graphify SKIP 0 · max-turns 1 · none arm-asymmetric. Open: `carbon-2981` 371 KB patch, `EMPTY PAYLOAD` detector bug. C idle (load 0.00).\n\n**Changed:** plan updated with R-A's verified numbers — **+4.3% to +6.0%** (down from +4.8–6.9%), bootstrap CI **[−11.2, +22.2]**, plus the sensitivity table and an explicit instruction not to run a single rep50 and report the token number, since at n=49 R-A is estimable but not demonstrable. Total revised to **+15.0% to +16.7%**.\n\nThat's three corrections the verification pass has now forced on my own plan: the ×0.54 calibration (wrong factor, should be the validated slope 0.822), the R-A point estimate (overstated ~0.7pt), and the false reconciliation claim. All three were caught by re-checking rather than by new cells.\n\n`devenv/EG-FINAL-PLAN.md` is current. Remaining to verify: the 69.1% coverage split, which is the load-bearing claim under the +10.7% coverage lever."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1740,"cache_read_input_tokens":552200,"output_tokens":736,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard"