{"parentUuid":"cbafdc49-6788-459f-a181-65d0ae85c227","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqY1NNrFeZGrgSfQgNR2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3333,"cache_read_input_tokens":557728,"output_tokens":2399,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3333,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2399,"cache_read_input_tokens":557728,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3333,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3333},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqY1HEnVDdrvcTQiWatT","attributionSkill":"loop","type":"assistant","uuid":"9e5379c3-393f-418f-84b8-0d1495600662","timestamp":"2026-08-08T15:41:49.945Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"9e5379c3-393f-418f-84b8-0d1495600662","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqY1NNrFeZGrgSfQgNR2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Fourth correction, and it shrinks the coverage lever substantially. Of the 481 identifiers the agent grepped for that weren't in the payload:\n\n| | count | share |\n|---|---|---|\n| **symbol exists in the graph** — payload just omitted it | 137 | **40.4%** → budget/ranking, fixable |\n| **not a graph symbol at all** | 202 | **59.6%** → not fixable |\n\nThe unfixable ones are exactly what you'd expect once you look: `deepcopy`, `assert`, `__version__`, `path_hooks` (stdlib/builtins), `required_if` (a string literal, not a definition), `_play_iterator` (a local variable), `test_play_iterator_nested` (a test function the payload deliberately demotes). None of those are questions a code graph can answer.\n\nSo the coverage lever is worth **≈ +4%**, not the +10.7% I had:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3333,"cache_read_input_tokens":557728,"output_tokens":2399,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3333,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2399,"cache_read_input_tokens":557728,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3333,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3333},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqY1HEnVDdrvcTQiWatT","attributionSkill":"loop","type":"assistant","uuid":"c6e9789f-a366-425d-8e4f-351fb19b3d7e","timestamp":"2026-08-08T15:41:53.469Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6b