{"parentUuid":"2faf94fe-389e-4f0b-8a7e-b6de6656f734","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqYg2rRv1gDkVJgWHhae","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Status**\n\n| cell | arm | n | TOKEN | CI | median | wins |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| rep50 4-arm | eg | 49/49 | +1.35% | [−16.9, +18.1] | −4.2% | 24/49 |\n| | cmm | 49/49 | −5.95% | [−28.2, +13.3] | −2.9% | 22/49 |\n| | graphify | 48/49 | −0.50% | [−16.4, +13.9] | −8.1% | 18/48 |\n| G2 (rider) | eg vs base | 10 | −12.19% | — | −14.45% | 3/10 |\n| G3 (displacement) | eg vs base | 11 | −1.24% | — | −0.40% | 5/11 |\n| Gemini 300 | — | 207 | −8.78% | — | — | VM A terminated |\n| rep30 | — | — | — | — | — | VM B terminated, 52 unfinished |\n\n**Flags:** wt 0 · cmm SKIP 0 · graphify SKIP 0 · max-turns 1 · none arm-asymmetric. Open: `carbon-2981` 371 KB patch, `EMPTY PAYLOAD` detector bug. C idle.\n\n**Changed — I ran the loop iteration early since nothing else was moving, and the byte-budget hypothesis is dead.** Replaying 14 sessions' recorded queries at the shipped 16 KB budget and at 4× (64 KB), checking whether the symbols the agent later grepped for appear:\n\n| | found | share of 64 wanted |\n|---|---|---|\n| @16 KB (shipped) | 3 | **5%** |\n| @64 KB (4× budget) | 7 | **11%** |\n| **budget-fixable** | +4 | **6%** |\n| **still missing at 4× budget** | 57 | **89%** |\n\nQuadrupling the payload recovers 6% of the gap. **89% of the reachable-but-omitted symbols are ranking-limited, not budget-limited** — the graph knows the symbol and still doesn't surface it for that query, at any budget I can afford to ship.\n\nThat kills the one-line fix and pushes the coverage lever below the ≈+4% I recorded an hour ago — the fixable slice is now 40.4% × ~11% ≈ 4% of the coverage gap, not 40%. And ranking work is the one thing the corpus has already refuted directly: gold-at-rank-1 sessions *lost* more often (6/8 vs 2/5).\n\n**Fifth consecutive correction, all downward.** Running total is now **R-A alone, +4.3% to +6.0%**, with the coverage lever effectively closed. Updating the plan."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3035,"cache_read_input_tokens":566711,"output_tokens":913,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3035,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":913,"cache_read_input_tokens":566711,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3035,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3035},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqYftJUniiTdxiv2BXpK","type":"assistant","uuid":"6b3db8f4-3d48-4bc5-aa79-26dcad091b5b","timestamp":"2026-08-08T15:50:35.113Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
