.98/session x2 arms\n  detect   4.3% : n=  989 pairs   ~$   7,872 at $3.98/session x2 arms\n  detect   6.0% : n=  499 pairs   ~$   3,972 at $3.98/session x2 arms\n  detect  10.0% : n=  173 pairs   ~$   1,377 at $3.98/session x2 arms\n  detect  15.0% : n=   73 pairs   ~$     581 at $3.98/session x2 arms\n  detect  17.2% : n=   54 pairs   ~$     430 at $3.98/session x2 arms\n  detect  21.0% : n=   35 pairs   ~$     279 at $3.98/session x2 arms\n  detect  35.0% : n=   11 pairs   ~$      88 at $3.98/session x2 arms\n\nWith paired replication (k runs per instance), sd falls as sqrt(1/k) only for run-level noise\n(measured ~87% of paired variance), so k=3 gives an effective sd of ~0.320:\n  detect   4.3% : n=  416 instances x3 runs = 1248 sessions/arm  ~$   9,934\n  detect   6.0% : n=  210 instances x3 runs = 630 sessions/arm  ~$   5,015\n  detect  10.0% : n=   73 instances x3 runs = 219 sessions/arm  ~$   1,743","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"fef71346-49ec-4286-a79d-39a22260948e","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"459ef46e-7ed0-430d-bf8b-26e7ca7c2f6e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqZb3PepjsGmiZjRzhAL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Status**\n\n| cell | arm | n | TOKEN | CI | median | wins |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| rep50 4-arm | eg | 49/49 | +1.35% | [−16.9, +18.1] | −4.2% | 24/49 |\n| | cmm | 49/49 | −5.95% | [−28.2, +13.3] | −2.9% | 22/49 |\n| | graphify | 48/49 | −0.50% | [−16.4, +13.9] | −8.1% | 18/48 |\n| G2 (rider) | eg vs base | 10 | −12.19% | — | −14.45% | 3/10 |\n| G3 (displacement) | eg vs base | 11 | −1.24% | — | −0.40% | 5/11 |\n| Gemini 300 | — | 207 | −8.78% | — | — | VM A terminated |\n| rep30 | — | — | — | — | — | VM B terminated, 52 unfinished |\n\n**Flags:** wt 0 · cmm SKIP 0 · graphify SKIP 0 · max-turns 1 · none arm-asymmetric. Open: `carbon-2981` 371 KB patch, `EMPTY PAYLOAD` detector bug. C idle.\n\n**Changed — ran the power analysis, and it reframes the whole programme.** Paired log-ratio: n=49, sd **0.494**. That gives **t = −0.17** on the current headline — **+1.35% is not distinguishable from zero.**\n\nWhat it costs to *demonstrate* rather than estimate an effect (80% power, α=0.05):\n\n| effect | pairs needed | ≈ cost |\n|---|---|---|\n| 35% | **11** | $88 |\n| 21% | 35 | $279 |\n| 17.2% | 54 | $430 |\n| 10% | 173 | $1,377 |\n| **6.0% (R-A upper)** | **499** | **$3,972** |\n| **4.3% (R-A lower)** | **989** | **$7,872** |\n\nWith 3× replication (run-level noise is ~87% of paired variance), R-A at 6% still needs **210 instances × 3 runs = 630 sessions/arm, ~$5,000**.\n\n**That's the real finding of this pass:** the surviving lever (+4.3–6.0%) is roughly **50–90× more expensive to prove** than the 35% target would have been. 35% was cheap to measure precisely because it was large; everything actually achievable sits below this benchmark's resolution at any n we'd run.\n\nSo the honest recommendation isn't \"run R-A on rep50\" — that would return another uninterpretable number. It's either fund a ~500-pair cell, or stop optimising tokens on this benchmark and report the tool on axes it can actually resolve. Adding to the plan."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2578,"cache_read_input_tokens":575194,"output_tokens":934,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2578,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":934,"cache_read_input_tokens":575194,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2578,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2578},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqZaviKL59ZTYNHpAKyb","type":"assistant","uuid":"d539ff28-ce45-4766-b7de-614298c5a090","timestamp":"2026-08-08T16:02:35.033Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
