t  +0.97%  n@6% =   230  (drops 9 pairs)\n  control-variate on baseline cost   sd 0.466  est  +1.21%  n@6% =   445  ** NOT VALID: baseline cost is an outcome, not a covariate\n\n  (beta=-0.209 -- eg's delta really does depend on how much the baseline spent,\n   which is the known corr(+0.305), but conditioning on it biases the estimate.)\n\nBLOW-UP CONCENTRATION — how much variance is in the tail?\n  dropping the 3 largest |deviation| pairs: sd 0.415  est  -6.19%  n@6% =   352\n  dropping the 5 largest |deviation| pairs: sd 0.386  est  -2.43%  n@6% =   306\n  dropping the 8 largest |deviation| pairs: sd 0.343  est  -0.48%  n@6% =   242","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3298ad05-166a-4913-8e94-1bef40d0b2a4","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
