{"parentUuid":"7649ffb2-7446-443e-bd86-5acc5e9f0737","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqZhMN4X41imKxyntaCH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3364,"cache_read_input_tokens":581628,"output_tokens":2402,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3364,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2402,"cache_read_input_tokens":581628,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3364,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3364},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqZhFjj7uxJ8XeQTpLmT","attributionSkill":"loop","type":"assistant","uuid":"9594244f-0188-4c69-9a05-5ecfa357b2c9","timestamp":"2026-08-08T16:03:58.838Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"9594244f-0188-4c69-9a05-5ecfa357b2c9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqZhMN4X41imKxyntaCH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Variance reduction works, but it exposes something more important than the n it saves:\n\n| estimator | sd | **point estimate** | n needed @6% |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| raw log-ratio | 0.494 | **+1.21%** | 499 |\n| winsorised 5/95 | 0.469 | +0.48% | 451 |\n| winsorised 10/90 | 0.398 | **−0.13%** | 326 |\n| winsorised 20/80 | 0.330 | **−0.26%** | 223 |\n| trimmed 10% both tails | 0.334 | +0.97% | 230 |\n| drop 3 largest deviations | 0.415 | **−6.19%** | 352 |\n\n**Every robust estimator moves the headline to zero or below.** The +1.35% is carried entirely by the tail — remove the three most extreme pairs and it's **−6.19%**. The median was already −4.2%, which agrees.\n\nThat reframes what the tool actually is: not systematically cheaper, but **occasional insurance against a catastrophic baseline blow-up** (`lombok-3674`: baseline ran `javac` 70×, eg 23×). Real value — just not a token-savings story, and not one that survives a robustness check.\n\nRecording it:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3364,"cache_read_input_tokens":581628,"output_tokens":2402,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3364,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2402,"cache_read_input_tokens":581628,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3364,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3364},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqZhFjj7uxJ8XeQTpLmT","attributionSkill":"loop","type":"assistant","uuid":"757ea357-f5b2-4c3d-b936-5d630d9fdd25","timestamp":"2026-08-08T16:04:03.108Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"757ea357-f5b2-4c3d-b936-5d630d9fdd25","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqZhMN4X41imKxyntaCH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_016RFPn8HRUZTFZBxMjQ1BEH","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\np='EG-FINAL-PLAN.md'; s=open(p).read()\nadd = \"\"\"\n---\n\n## 8. The instrument cannot see the effect — and the effect is tail-carried\n\n**8.1 Power.** Paired log-ratio: n=49, **sd 0.494**. The current headline gives **t = −0.17** —\n**+1.35% is not distinguishable from zero.** What it costs to *demonstrate* rather than estimate\n(80% power, α=0.05, $3.98/session × 2 arms):\n\n| effect | pairs | ≈ cost |\n|---|---|---|\n| 35% | **11** | $88 |\n| 21% | 35 | $279 |\n| 17.2% | 54 | $430 |\n| 10% | 173 | $1,377 |\n| 6.0% (R-A upper) | **499** | **$3,972** |\n| 4.3% (R-A lower) | **989** | **$7,872** |\n\n**35% would have been trivial to prove — n=11.** The reason it cannot be shown is not measurement\ncost; it is that the effect is not there. Everything actually achievable sits below this\nbenchmark's resolution at any n worth running.\n\n**8.2 Variance reduction helps, but only 2.2×.** Symmetric, pre-registerable estimators:\n\n| estimator | sd | estimate | n@6% |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| raw | 0.494 | +1.21% | 499 |\n| winsorised 20/80 | **0.330** | −0.26% | **223** |\n| trimmed 10% both tails | 0.334 | +0.97% | 230 |\n\nBest case n=223 (~$1,775). A control variate on baseline cost would cut sd further but is\n**invalid** — baseline cost is an outcome, not a pre-treatment covariate, so conditioning on it\nbiases the estimate. Do not use it.\n\n**8.3 The finding that matters most: the headline is tail-carried.**\n\n| robustification | estimate |\n|---|---|\n| raw | **+1.21%** |\n| winsorised 10/90 | −0.13% |\n| winsorised 20/80 | −0.26% |\n| drop 3 largest deviations | **−6.19%** |\n| drop 5 | −2.43% |\n| drop 8 | −0.48% |\n\n**Every robust estimator moves the result to zero or below**, and the median was already −4.2%.\nThe positive headline rests on a few extreme pairs — chiefly `lombok-3674` (+71.0%), where the\n*baseline* ran `javac` 70 times against eg's 23.\n\n**So the honest characterisation of the tool is not \"saves tokens\".** It is: *centrally neutral,\nwith occasional protection against a catastrophic baseline blow-up.* That is a real property and\nworth claiming — tail risk is expensive — but it is a different claim, it needs a different\nestimator (something like P(cost ratio > 1.5), which is far cheaper to power), and it should not\nbe reported as a mean token saving.\n\n**8.4 Recommendation.** Do **not** run R-A on a rep50; it would return another uninterpretable\nnumber. Either fund ~220–500 pairs, or switch the endpoint to tail risk, or stop optimising\ntokens on this benchmark and report the tool on axes it can resolve.\n\"\"\"\ns = s.rstrip() + \"\\n\" + add\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nprint(\"added section 8:\", \"tail-carried\" in s, len(s))\nPY\ngrep -n \"^## \" EG-FINAL-PLAN.md","description":"Add power and tail-carried findings to plan"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3364,"cache_read_input_tokens":581628,"output_tokens":2402,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3364,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2402,"cache_read_input_tokens":581628,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3364,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3364},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqZhFjj7uxJ8XeQTpLmT","attributionSkill":"loop","type":"assistant","uuid":"c7c1a159-bc4e-4af9-8376-7ffe1681c8a9","timestamp":"2026-08-08T16:04:16.964Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"c7c1a159-bc4e-4af9-8376-7ffe1681c8a9","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"0e62dc9d-15c6-46a2-b200-860dc51c2df7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016RFPn8HRUZTFZBxMjQ1BEH","type":"tool_result","content":"added section 8: True 18774\n9:## 1. The metric is context, not messages\n26:## 2. The complete budget\n74:## 3. Why the uncaptured cost is uncaptured — the decisive split\n105:## 4. The ceiling, computed from the budget\n197:## 5. What to do, in order\n267:## 6. Struck — measured, do not re-propose\n300:## 7. Corrections issued this session\n319:## 8. The instrument cannot see the effect — and the effect is tail-carried","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"f94c4d73-c5c8-40bd-a271-787ce6ae8602","timestamp":"2026-08-08T16:04:19.590Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"added section 8: True 18774\n9:## 1. The metric is context, not messages\n26:## 2. The complete budget\n74:## 3. Why the uncaptured cost is uncaptured — the decisive split\n105:## 4. The ceiling, computed from the budget\n197:## 5. What to do, in order\n267:## 6. Struck — measured, do not re-propose\n300:## 7. Corrections issued this session\n319:## 8. The instrument cannot see the effect — and the effect is tail-carried","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c7c1a159-bc4e-4af9-8376-7ffe1681c8a9","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"f94c4d73-c5c8-40bd-a271-787ce6ae8602","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"task_reminder","content":[],"itemCount":0},"type":"attachment","uuid":"560cb323-e1a7-4537-bb30-eb7137ed69a9","timestamp":"2026-08-08T16:04:19.600Z","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"560cb323-e1a7-4537-bb30-eb7137ed69a9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqZk12HELCpJYYw4BRpc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm self-pacing this loop — no external event to wait on, so no Monitor; the work is offline analysis against data already on disk. I ran this iteration now and it produced the session's most consequential result, which is in `devenv/EG-FINAL-PLAN.md` §8.\n\n**This iteration:** the goal is unreachable for a reason I hadn't identified until now — it isn't only that the effect is small, it's that **the benchmark cannot see effects this size at all**, and the effect it does show doesn't survive robustness.\n\n- **t = −0.17** on the current headline. +1.35% is statistically indistinguishable from zero.\n- **35% would have needed only n=11 to prove ($88).** +6% needs n=499 ($3,972). The target was cheap to measure precisely because it was fictitious; everything real sits under the noise floor.\n- **Every robust estimator drives the result to zero or negative** — winsorised 20/80 gives −0.26%, dropping the 3 most extreme pairs gives −6.19%, and the median was already −4.2%.\n\nThe defensible characterisation is therefore **centrally neutral, with occasional protection against a catastrophic baseline blow-up** — which is genuinely valuable (tail risk is expensive) but is a different claim needing a different endpoint, e.g. `P(cost ratio > 1.5)`, which powers far more cheaply than a mean.\n\n**Recommendation now in the plan: do not run R-A on a rep50.** It would return another uninterpretable number. Either fund ~220–500 pairs, switch the endpoint to tail risk, or stop optimising tokens on this benchmark.\n\nNext iteration will test the tail-risk endpoint directly — computing `P(ratio > 1.5)` for both arms on the existing 49 pairs and its required n — since that's the one framing where the tool may have a demonstrable effect at affordable cost. Scheduling 20 minutes; that's enough to do it properly without idle ticks."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2699,"cache_read_input_tokens":584992,"output_tokens":862,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2699,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":862,"cache_read_input_tokens":584992,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2699,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2699},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqZjoSGQwo6mNUZYxbPf","attributionSkill":"loop","type":"assistant","uuid":"97a29a3b-17fc-4607-a437-76853d4c1397","timestamp":"2026-08-08T16:04:34.996Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
