{"parentUuid":"dfa3c4e6-5fd2-42a0-9df3-f75d7b9a9839","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"0e62dc9d-15c6-46a2-b200-860dc51c2df7","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Tt1gubKHVcpDCk4xCtVFcC","type":"tool_result","content":"Next wakeup scheduled for 12:25:00 (in 1221s). Nothing more to do this turn — the harness re-invokes you when the wakeup fires or a task-notification arrives."}]},"uuid":"f67c3020-9bb7-4976-af0a-a07825a6107f","timestamp":"2026-08-08T16:04:38.613Z","toolUseResult":{"scheduledFor":1786206300000,"clampedDelaySeconds":1200,"wasClamped":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"dfa3c4e6-5fd2-42a0-9df3-f75d7b9a9839","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"f67c3020-9bb7-4976-af0a-a07825a6107f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqZmKZXDxE23XXzbUu9a","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Loop re-armed, next iteration in ~20 min.\n\n**Summary of where the goal stands after this iteration:**\n\nThe answer to \"can we hit 35%\" is now settled from a direction I hadn't tried — measurement power rather than mechanism:\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| current headline | +1.35%, **t = −0.17** — indistinguishable from zero |\n| n to prove 35% | **11 pairs, $88** |\n| n to prove +6% (best surviving lever) | **499 pairs, $3,972** |\n| headline after dropping 3 extreme pairs | **−6.19%** |\n| median | −4.2% |\n\n**35% was cheap to measure and isn't there. What's achievable is real but invisible at any n we'd run.** And the positive headline that does exist is tail-carried — it doesn't survive winsorising or trimming.\n\nSix corrections this session, every one downward: +35.06% → artifact · message-displacement → context density · ×0.54 → slope 0.822 · R-A +4.8–6.9% → +4.3–6.0% · coverage +10.7% → +4% → +0.5% (closed) · headline +1.35% → **not distinguishable from zero, tail-carried**.\n\nTwo things shipped and deployed regardless: **R-A** (`b669a57b` — fixes a genuine defect where prefetch delivered the payload twice and paid full price once) and the **path/batched-def verbs** (`607b2a4`, `8d6262ff`)."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":929,"cache_read_input_tokens":587691,"output_tokens":490,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":929,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":490,"cache_read_input_tokens":587691,"cache_creation_input_tokens":929,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_