{"parentUuid":"7ab1cade-ab63-4a18-891e-6a0dc76b16e2","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqZxBAZ8NQvwPzevKPj1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Status**\n\n| cell | arm | n | TOKEN | CI | median | wins |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| rep50 4-arm | eg | 49/49 | +1.35% | [−16.9, +18.1] | −4.2% | 24/49 |\n| | cmm | 49/49 | −5.95% | [−28.2, +13.3] | −2.9% | 22/49 |\n| | graphify | 48/49 | −0.50% | [−16.4, +13.9] | −8.1% | 18/48 |\n| G2 (rider) | eg vs base | 10 | −12.19% | — | −14.45% | 3/10 |\n| G3 (displacement) | eg vs base | 11 | −1.24% | — | −0.40% | 5/11 |\n| Gemini 300 | — | 207 | −8.78% | — | — | VM A terminated |\n| rep30 | — | — | — | — | — | VM B terminated, 52 unfinished |\n\n**Flags:** wt 0 · cmm SKIP 0 · graphify SKIP 0 · max-turns 1 · none arm-asymmetric. Open: `carbon-2981` 371 KB patch, `EMPTY PAYLOAD` detector bug. C idle.\n\n**Changed — I ran the next loop iteration early, and the tail-risk endpoint is dead too.** I proposed it last cycle as the one framing where the tool might show a demonstrable effect cheaply. It doesn't:\n\n| blow-up threshold | eg | baseline | McNemar p |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| >1.25× | 17/49 | 17/49 | 1.000 |\n| **>1.5×** | **11/49** | **10/49** | **1.000** |\n| >2.0× | 4/49 | 4/49 | 1.000 |\n| >2.5× | 0/49 | **3/49** | 0.250 |\n| >3.0× | 0/49 | **2/49** | 0.500 |\n\nThe arms blow up at **identical rates** — 22.4% vs 20.4% at 1.5×, requiring **n=6,338 (~$50,450)** to resolve, 13× worse than the mean endpoint. So my own \"insurance against tail risk\" framing from last cycle is **retracted**.\n\nThe one glimmer: at ≥2.5× the extremes are **all baseline** (3–0 and 2–0), consistent with `lombok-3674`. But at n=49 that's p=0.25 — suggestive, not evidence.\n\n**Seventh correction, and it closes the last open route.** Every endpoint tried — mean tokens, robust mean, tail risk — is either null or unmeasurable. The plan's recommendation stands and is now better founded: don't run another rep50; either fund ~500 pairs or report the tool on axes this benchmark can resolve."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2448,"cache_read_input_tokens":589229,"output_tokens":944,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2448,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":944,"cache_read_input_tokens":589229,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2448,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2448},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqZx3zTJxhcbzfBSEWGE","type":"assistant","uuid":"bc4dd2e6-ebe2-43a7-b60b-9d136fe5986d","timestamp":"2026-08-08T16:07:21.326Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
