{"parentUuid":"94e82e43-a34d-4993-a9e9-dc7157f5d09d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cdqb1sYdTGVZyVKCULkCt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Status**\n\n| cell | arm | n | TOKEN | CI | median | wins |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| rep50 4-arm | eg | 49/49 | +1.35% | [−16.9, +18.1] | −4.2% | 24/49 |\n| | cmm | 49/49 | −5.95% | [−28.2, +13.3] | −2.9% | 22/49 |\n| | graphify | 48/49 | −0.50% | [−16.4, +13.9] | −8.1% | 18/48 |\n| G2 (rider) | eg vs base | 10 | −12.19% | — | −14.45% | 3/10 |\n| G3 (displacement) | eg vs base | 11 | −1.24% | — | −0.40% | 5/11 |\n| Gemini 300 | — | 207 | −8.78% | — | — | VM A terminated |\n| rep30 | — | — | — | — | — | VM B terminated, 52 unfinished |\n\n**Flags:** wt 0 · cmm SKIP 0 · graphify SKIP 0 · max-turns 1 · none arm-asymmetric. Open: `carbon-2981` 371 KB patch, `EMPTY PAYLOAD` detector bug.\n\n**Changed: nothing** — third identical poll. C idle (load 0.00), A and B TERMINATED, all cells final, nothing running.\n\nThese polls have no new information to report until something is launched. The analysis work is finished and written up; the open decisions are yours:\n\n1. Restart A/B (non-preemptible) to finish Gemini 300 and the 52 rep30 sessions?\n2. Fund a ~220–500 pair cell to actually resolve R-A (+4.3–6.0%)?\n3. Fix the two open defects (`EMPTY PAYLOAD` detector, junk-patch gate)?\n4. Stop the loop?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":924,"cache_read_input_tokens":597101,"output_tokens":629,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":924,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":629,"cache_read_input_tokens":597101,"cache_creation_input_tokens":924,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemer