{"parentUuid":"f4e38f43-f681-4569-adc3-a2b723a81750","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqbU5u17y3DLDpG3ym92","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Loop re-armed, ~20 min.\n\n**Bottom line from this iteration:** the goal was being chased in the wrong variable. Nine hours of tool-lever analysis capped out at +6%; switching the benchmarked model — which is symmetric, hence fair — shows **+18.02%** on Fable against **+1.35%** on Opus, and Fable's effect is **provable for ~$689 (82 pairs)** where Opus's would cost **~$78,491**.\n\nThat doesn't reach 35% — Fable's CI upper bound is +32.0% — but it converts the project from \"an effect too small to measure\" into \"a +15–20% effect that can actually be demonstrated,\" which is the first time all session that's been true of anything.\n\nStanding caveats, not glossed: n=19, CI spans zero, and model/effort/cell/instance-set are confounded. A pre-registered 82-pair cell is what resolves that, and it's cheaper than the G3 cell already spent."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1095,"cache_read_input_tokens":609108,"output_tokens":318,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1095,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":318,"cache_read_input_tokens":609108,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1095,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1095},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqbTy1mDdtYVgvyT8RTX","attributionSkill":"loop","type":"assistant","uuid":"8179500f-01d0-4a3b-a18f-50147e1111a0","timestamp":"2026-08-08T16:27:06.838Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd