{"parentUuid":"bd21d06a-3c82-42b6-bcac-3b5c02e68178","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqcEKdUqVXcVqd1yVBrf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Status**\n\n| cell | arm | n | TOKEN | CI | median | wins |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| rep50 4-arm | eg | 49/49 | +1.35% | [−16.9, +18.1] | −4.2% | 24/49 |\n| | cmm | 49/49 | −5.95% | [−28.2, +13.3] | −2.9% | 22/49 |\n| | graphify | 48/49 | −0.50% | [−16.4, +13.9] | −8.1% | 18/48 |\n| G2 (rider) | eg vs base | 10 | −12.19% | — | −14.45% | 3/10 |\n| G3 (displacement) | eg vs base | 11 | −1.24% | — | −0.40% | 5/11 |\n| fable/max | eg vs base | 19 | +18.02% | [−6.3, +32.0] | +16.42% | 13/19 |\n| Gemini 300 | — | 207 | −8.78% | — | — | VM A terminated |\n| rep30 | — | — | — | — | — | VM B terminated, 52 unfinished |\n\n**Flags:** wt 0 · cmm SKIP 0 · graphify SKIP 0 · rep50 max-turns 1 · none arm-asymmetric. Open: `carbon-2981` 371 KB patch, `EMPTY PAYLOAD` detector bug.\n\n**Changed — diagnosed the fable 25→19 loss, and it's benign:** all 9 unreadable files are **0 bytes**, and 4 of the 5 affected instances failed in **both** arms (`phpspreadsheet-4214`, `lombok-3486`, `bat-2260`, `valkey-1499`), with one baseline-only (`redis-10095`).\n\nThat's a session that died before writing output — infrastructure, not arm bias — and it's near-symmetric by construction since the same instances fail on both sides. It does not threaten the +18.02%.\n\nTwo consequences for the pre-registered cell: launch **~90 pairs to land 82** given the ~24% loss rate, and add a preflight that treats a 0-byte `cc_out.json` as a retry rather than a silent drop.\n\nNo cells running; C idle. Next iteration writes the pre-registration."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1290,"cache_read_input_tokens":615323,"output_tokens":757,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"s