{"parentUuid":"93370db9-d102-48e9-9851-801ab38d8873","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqcdSSPvn6KjAXGSrZck","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Status**\n\n| cell | arm | n | TOKEN | CI | median | wins |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| rep50 4-arm | eg | 49/49 | +1.35% | [−16.9, +18.1] | −4.2% | 24/49 |\n| | cmm | 49/49 | −5.95% | [−28.2, +13.3] | −2.9% | 22/49 |\n| | graphify | 48/49 | −0.50% | [−16.4, +13.9] | −8.1% | 18/48 |\n| G2 (rider) | eg vs base | 10 | −12.19% | — | −14.45% | 3/10 |\n| G3 (displacement) | eg vs base | 11 | −1.24% | — | −0.40% | 5/11 |\n| fable/max | eg vs base | 19 | +18.02% | [−6.3, +32.0] | +16.42% | 13/19 |\n| Gemini 300 | — | 207 | −8.78% | — | — | VM A terminated |\n| rep30 | — | — | — | — | — | VM B terminated, 52 unfinished |\n\n**Flags:** wt 0 · cmm SKIP 0 · graphify SKIP 0 · rep50 max-turns 1 · none arm-asymmetric. Open: `carbon-2981` 371 KB patch, `EMPTY PAYLOAD` detector bug. C idle, nothing running.\n\n**Changed:** wrote the pre-registration — **`devenv/PREREG-FABLE82.md`**, fixed before launch per doctrine.\n\n- **H1:** fable/max geomean > 0 at α=0.05. Point prediction **+14.6%**, interval **[+5%, +25%]**, n=**82 gated pairs** (launch ~90 for the 24% loss rate), ≈**$756**\n- **PASS/WEAK/FAIL fixed now**, and it states plainly that **35% is not the target and will not be claimed** — Fable's pilot CI tops out at +32.0%\n- **R-A stays OFF** — one variable per cell\n- Five preflight requirements, including the 0-byte retry fix and the `EMPTY PAYLOAD` detector\n- Confounds stated before seeing the result: model×effort×cell×instance-set are confounded; this tests whether Fable's effect is real, **not** that Fable beats Opus\n- Secondary analysis pre-specified: winsorised 20/80, because rep50's headline did *not* survive winsorising (+1.21% → −0.26%)\n\nReady to launch on your word. It's cheaper than the G3 cell already spent, and it's the only route where the observed effect is provable rather than merely estimated."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":794,"cache_read_input_tokens":619869,"output_tokens":902,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":794,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":902,"cache_read_input_tokens":619869,"cache_creation_input_tokens":794,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":794},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqcdJjJ5aonrJYenkDdz","type":"assistant","uuid":"92c20f85-ed69-40af-81bc-a85390bd5c43","timestamp":"2026-08-08T16:42:26.502Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
