{"parentUuid":"e12d17ca-df79-4061-96bf-58809de88ff5","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqhmrWJGF64LReTkSVtp","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Status**\n\n| cell | arm | n | TOKEN | CI | median | wins |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| rep50 4-arm | eg | 49/49 | +1.35% | [−16.9, +18.1] | −4.2% | 24/49 |\n| | cmm | 49/49 | −5.95% | [−28.2, +13.3] | −2.9% | 22/49 |\n| | graphify | 48/49 | −0.50% | [−16.4, +13.9] | −8.1% | 18/48 |\n| G2 (rider) | eg vs base | 10 | −12.19% | — | −14.45% | 3/10 |\n| G3 (displacement) | eg vs base | 11 | −1.24% | — | −0.40% | 5/11 |\n| FAB82 | — | killed at 1 pair | — | — | — | $15.71, off-policy |\n| Gemini 300 | — | 207 | −8.78% | — | — | VM A terminated |\n| rep30 | — | — | — | — | — | VM B terminated, 52 unfinished |\n\n**Flags:** wt 0 · cmm SKIP 0 · graphify SKIP 0 · rep50 max-turns 1 · none arm-asymmetric. Nothing running (0 sessions, 0 drivers, load 0.00).\n\n**Changed — one finding that reframes the eg row above.** Leave-one-out on the headline:\n\n| estimator | value |\n|---|---|\n| total (as reported) | +1.35% |\n| **drop `lombok-3674`** | **−5.18%** |\n| drop `bat-1892` | +4.32% |\n| median | −4.16% |\n| **10% trimmed mean** | **−7.65%** |\n\nThe +1.35% is **one instance**. Every robust estimator says eg *loses* on Opus. I'd been reporting the total each cycle without the LOO check — that column should be read as \"indistinguishable from a ~4–8% loss,\" not as a small win.\n\nThree read-only investigations are running: a 4-lens audit workflow over all artifacts/data, plus two Opus agents dissecting the worst losers (`bat-1892`/`valkey-790`, `ansible-395e`/`prometheus-9248`) to find what capability would collapse their extra turns. No cells are running and nothing is being spent on the benchmark."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":826,"cache_read_input_tokens":731561,