{"parentUuid":"2a77f8d6-e121-4b9a-8980-95de87438548","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqhpmaU2yMN5Uo22it49","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":928,"cache_read_input_tokens":732387,"output_tokens":1985,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":928,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":1985,"cache_read_input_tokens":732387,"cache_creation_input_tokens":928,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":928},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqhpcWkn7G6Vw3Ni2D8k","type":"assistant","uuid":"3b2531f3-1163-405d-8f4f-c0f39345ad09","timestamp":"2026-08-08T17:50:39.878Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"3b2531f3-1163-405d-8f4f-c0f39345ad09","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqhpmaU2yMN5Uo22it49","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Three, and they're measured and distinct:\n\n## 1. The call gets paid for and removes nothing\n\nIn the losing half the graph displaces **zero** exploration:\n\n| | eg | baseline |\n|---|---|---|\n| shell exploration, losers | **413** | **415** |\n| shell exploration, winners | 370 | 440 |\n\nTwo calls out of 415. Meanwhile the call itself costs ~**1.61 messages**, and its payload then sits in context being re-charged every remaining turn. So in losers it's pure overhead — a regression holding call-count fixed prices **+7.0%** [1.9, 13.2] for merely having called.\n\n## 2. ADD tasks — the graph always answers, even when there's nothing to find\n\nSearch never says \"this doesn't exist here.\" On a task that means *add new behaviour*, it returns a confident wrong hit, and the agent follows it.\n\n| task kind | pooled result |\n|---|---|\n| **MOD** (fix existing broken code) | **+14.35%** (n=36) |\n| **ADD** (behaviour doesn't exist yet) | **−3.37%** (n=21) |\n\nSame sign in **4/4 cells**, across both models and both prompts — a ~17.7pt gap. Corroborated by: gold at rank 2–3 (**−85.3%**) is *worse* than gold not found at all (−25.6%). A plausible wrong answer costs more than no answer.\n\n## 3. The verify-repair spiral, where the tool isn't present\n\n**91 of 94 graph calls happen before the first edit. 42/49 sessions never call it again.** But 97.7% of the excess cost lands *after* that edit:\n\n| | losers (eg vs base) | winners |\n|---|---|---|\n| harness ENV failures | **+22** | −45 |\n| throwaway scripts run | +16 | −48 |\n| post-edit harness runs | +50 | −88 |\n| **post-edit exploration** | **+159** | −81 |\n\nThe chain: the verification command fails on the *environment* rather than the patch → the agent improvises a throwaway harness → then re-explores to repair that. `corr(Δenv-failures, saving) = −0.442`, `corr(Δharness runs) = −0.612`.\n\n---\n\n**The uncomfortable part:** reason 1 and reason 3 are both \"the graph isn't where the cost is.\" Pre-edit it genuinely works — exploration falls in *both* groups (−46 losers, −58 winners). Localization was never the problem. Losing happens entirely downstream of it, in a phase the tool doesn't reach.\n\nOnly **#2 is a defect the graph itself can fix** — and the fix is abstention, which was tried and struck (confidence gating measured worse). The two Opus investigators are on exactly this question now; I'll revise if they find something concrete."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":928,"cache_read_input_tokens":732387,"output_tokens":1985,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":928,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":1985,"cache_read_input_tokens":732387,"cache_creation_input_tokens":928,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":928},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqhpcWkn7G6Vw3Ni2D8k","type":"assistant","uuid":"8ce9ba79-48ef-4131-b7b5-ff00c2df62f5","timestamp":"2026-08-08T17:50:50.679Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
