{"parentUuid":"2198fc25-78c2-42c8-b595-c30fac25b85f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqhsufU42dkdfADNqFmF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Status**\n\n| cell | arm | n | TOKEN | median | 10% trimmed | wins |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| rep50 4-arm | eg | 49/49 | +1.35% | −4.16% | **−7.65%** | 24/49 |\n| | cmm | 49/49 | −5.95% | −2.9% | — | 22/49 |\n| | graphify | 48/49 | −0.50% | −8.1% | — | 18/48 |\n| G2 (rider) | eg vs base | 10 | −12.19% | −14.45% | — | 3/10 |\n| G3 (displacement) | eg vs base | 11 | −1.24% | −0.40% | — | 5/11 |\n| Gemini 300 | — | 207 | −8.78% | — | — | VM A terminated |\n| rep30 | — | — | — | — | — | VM B terminated, 52 unfinished |\n\n**Flags:** wt 0 · cmm SKIP 0 · graphify SKIP 0 · rep50 max-turns 1 · none arm-asymmetric. Nothing running.\n\n**Changed: nothing on the machines** — 0 sessions, 0 drivers, load 0.00. I've added the trimmed-mean column to the eg row since the LOO result makes the bare total misleading on its own (drop `lombok-3674` → −5.18%).\n\nThree read-only investigations still in flight: the 4-lens artifact/data audit workflow, and two Opus agents on the worst losers. No benchmark spend."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":826,"cache_read_input_tokens":735418,"output_tokens":513,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":826,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":513,"cache_read_input_tokens":735418,"cache_creation_input_tokens":826,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":826},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqhsjhgxrYnh8NP9YJWW","type":"assistant","uuid":"3b7e587c-84d8-4a35-a459-7d9ef2a5791f","timestamp":"2026-08-08T17:51:11.779Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"3b7e587c-84d8-4a35-a459-7d9ef2a5791f","isSidechain":false,"type":"system","subtype":"stop_hook_summary","hookCount":2,"hookInfos":[{"command":"sh -c 'if ! command -v entire >/dev/null 2>&1; then exit 0; fi; exec entire hooks claude-code stop'","durationMs":39},{"command":"node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/stop-review-gate-hook.mjs\"","durationMs":51}],"hookErrors":[],"hookAdditionalContext":[],"preventedContinuation":false,"stopReason":"","hasOutput":false,"level":"suggestion","timestamp":"2026-08-08T17:51:11.917Z","uuid":"2ba9a069-3e4b-4fe2-8c20-7b2f3e41f0b8","toolUseID":"50f8d35e-6ef7-4aaf-8ecc-eae5e8aa05fc","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"2ba9a069-3e4b-4fe2-8c20-7b2f3e41f0b8","isSidechain":false,"type":"system","subtype":"turn_duration","durationMs":21078,"messageCount":1621,"pendingBackgroundAgentCount":2,"pendingWorkflowCount":1,"timestamp":"2026-08-08T17:51:11.918Z","uuid":"28808b21-4d8d-4f16-8752-cbfb33b2724f","isMeta":false,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"28808b21-4d8d-4f16-8752-cbfb33b2724f","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"46bfb63d-25dc-4661-aa22-95b5a836ced8","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"launch a workflow to fix this;1. The call gets paid for and removes nothing\n\n  In the losing half the graph displaces zero exploration:\n\n  ┌────────────────────────────┬─────┬──────────┐\n  │                            │ eg  │ baseline │\n  ├────────────────────────────┼─────┼──────────┤\n  │ shell exploration, losers  │ 413 │ 415      │\n  ├────────────────────────────┼─────┼──────────┤\n  │ shell exploration, winners │ 370 │ 440      │\n  └────────────────────────────┴─────┴──────────┘\n\n  Two calls out of 415. Meanwhile the call itself costs ~1.61 messages, and its payload then sits in context being re-charged every remaining\n  turn. So in losers it's pure overhead — a regression holding call-count fixed prices +7.0% [1.9, 13.2] for merely having called.\n\n  2. ADD tasks — the graph always answers, even when there's nothing to find\n\n  Search never says \"this doesn't exist here.\" On a task that means add new behaviour, it returns a confident wrong hit, and the agent follows\n  it.\n\n  ┌───────────────────────────────────┬────────────────┐\n  │             task kind             │ pooled result  │\n  ├───────────────────────────────────┼────────────────┤\n  │ MOD (fix existing broken code)    │ +14.35% (n=36) │\n  ├───────────────────────────────────┼────────────────┤\n  │ ADD (behaviour doesn't exist yet) │ −3.37% (n=21)  │\n  └───────────────────────────────────┴────────────────┘\n\n  Same sign in 4/4 cells, across both models and both prompts — a ~17.7pt gap. Corroborated by: gold at rank 2–3 (−85.3%) is worse than gold\n  not found at all (−25.6%). A plausible wrong answer costs more than no answer.\n\n  3. The verify-repair spiral, where the tool isn't present\n\n  91 of 94 graph calls happen before the first edit. 42/49 sessions never call it again. But 97.7% of the excess cost lands after that edit:\n\n  ┌────────────────────────┬─────────────────────┬─────────┐\n  │                        │ losers (eg vs base) │ winners │\n  ├────────────────────────┼─────────────────────┼─────────┤\n  │ harness ENV failures   │ +22                 │ −45     │\n  ├────────────────────────┼─────────────────────┼─────────┤\n  │ throwaway scripts run  │ +16                 │ −48     │\n  ├────────────────────────┼─────────────────────┼─────────┤\n  │ post-edit harness runs │ +50                 │ −88     │\n  ├────────────────────────┼─────────────────────┼─────────┤\n  │ post-edit exploration  │ +159                │ −81     │\n  └────────────────────────┴─────────────────────┴─────────┘\n\n  The chain: the verification command fails on the environment rather than the patch → the agent improvises a throwaway harness → then\n  re-explores to repair that. corr(Δenv-failures, saving) = −0.442, corr(Δharness runs) = −0.612."},"uuid":"5408d9eb-9f1c-460e-afb5-c69c26b11351","timestamp":"2026-08-08T17:51:36.249Z","permissionMode":"plan","origin":{"kind":"human"},"promptSource":"typed","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
