ESEARCH): internal/cli/search.go:132-135,286-293 (~10 LOC dispatcher, but short-circuits the ENTIRE pipeline — profile/repo/cache/index never touched).\n- **--to/--from/--relation targeted edge query**: internal/cli/root.go:303-346,466-511 (~100 LOC). Fully functional, contradicts AGENTS.md's claim it doesn't exist.\n- **`changed` subcommand**: internal/cli/changed.go, 383 LOC. Full working-tree diff-to-symbol impact analyzer, invisible to `--help`.\n- **--deep sparse/BM25 fusion pass**: internal/sem/search.go (~24 refs, gated by `options.Deep`, default false). Own comment: \"reads every eligible file\" — exhaustive path.\n- **Reference blocks** (container-map/signature-types/type-card): internal/sem/search_container_map.go (816 LOC) + nested_containers.go (102 LOC) = 918 LOC. Entirely off by default; reachable only via undocumented flags or ENTIRE_GRAPH_REFERENCE_BLOCKS.\n- **--callee-hop**: internal/sem/search_callee.go, 509 LOC. Off by default.\n- **--full-unit-top / --edit-site-bodies**: shared machinery internal/sem/search_enclosure.go, 1353 LOC. Both default 0/false.\n- **--file-outline**: internal/sem/search_outline.go, 217 LOC. Off by default.\n- **--path path-scope filter**: internal/cli/search_pathscope.go, 80 LOC. Off by default.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>118315</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>49</tool_uses><duration_ms>291214</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
