{"parentUuid":"8d2b52e4-d0fe-44ce-8f6a-5578f6d5f1e6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqiZRG3BXghRyc2eTnd6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Appendix A is now the findings log — every subagent entry with what it claimed and whether it survived checking (A1 hook: rejected; A2 forensics: graph payload was *correct* in both losers; A3 answer leak: confirmed live; A4 provisioning claim: refuted, replaced by the −14.49% finding).\n\nOn the standalone notepad and the skill: **plan mode restricts me to the plan file only**, so I can't create `.claude/skills/` entries or a separate notepad file yet. Appendix A is serving that purpose in the meantime, and it's structured so it can be lifted out verbatim.\n\nTwo things still outstanding before the full plan: the 4-lens audit workflow, the second loser dissection (`ansible`/`prometheus`), the capability inventory, and the three-defect fix workflow."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6904,"cache_read_input_tokens":772850,"output_tokens":1358,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6904,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1358,"cache_read_input_tokens":772850,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6904,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6904},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqiZJwnDy86wELDfUs4S","type":"assistant","uuid":"8eab40fa-b7fc-4451-9db9-11efb2d149b1","timestamp":"2026-08-08T18:00:12.591Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"8eab40fa-b7fc-4451-9db9-11efb2d149b1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqiZRG3BXghRyc2eTnd6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01RY1kiN4jqjhb6y4vcewCEa","name":"AskUserQuestion","input":{"questions":[{"question":"Plan mode blocks me from creating the notepad file and the skill. How should I handle that?","header":"Notepad","multiSelect":false,"options":[{"label":"Exit plan mode now, build both (Recommended)","description":"I exit, create devenv/SUBAGENT-LOG.md plus a /agentlog skill to view and append entries, then continue collecting results into it. The plan itself stays unfinished until the remaining agents land."},{"label":"Keep everything in the plan file","description":"Appendix A continues as the log. Nothing new is created until the plan is finalised and approved, then I lift it into a standalone notepad and skill in one pass."},{"label":"Wait for all agents, then do both at once","description":"Finish collecting, finalise the plan, and create the notepad and skill together as part of the same implementation step."}]},{"question":"Given eg loses 14.49% on the 20 pairs where BOTH arms genuinely build and test, but wins 9.71% where neither does — which reading should the plan commit to?","header":"Interpretation","multiSelect":false,"options":[{"label":"Verification is the defect — target it (Recommended)","description":"Treat the verify-repair spiral as the mechanism and build the VERIFY runnability probe plus test-invocation card. Consistent with harness corr −0.612 and env-failures −0.442."},{"label":"The metric is the defect","description":"Sessions that skip real verification look cheap and win on tokens. That means the benchmark partly rewards not doing the work, and the endpoint needs changing before any tool conclusion is drawn."},{"label":"Both, and separate them first","description":"Run a read-only audit splitting the 20 both-built pairs to see whether eg's extra cost is genuine waste or genuine work, before committing the plan to either reading."}]}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6904,"cache_read_input_tokens":772850,"output_tokens":1358,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6904,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1358,"cache_read_input_tokens":772850,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6904,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6904},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqiZJwnDy86wELDfUs4S","type":"assistant","uuid":"e4911423-3fdc-4c6a-bcc3-ee41379479c3","timestamp":"2026-08-08T18:00:22.102Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"e4911423-3fdc-4c6a-bcc3-ee41379479c3","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"73ad9440-9a58-440e-af70-6a71cac59596","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","content":"The user answered: \"Plan mode blocks me from creating the notepad file and the skill. How should I handle that?\"=\"Keep everything in the plan file\", \"Given eg loses 14.49% on the 20 pairs where BOTH arms genuinely build and test, but wins 9.71% where neither does — which reading should the plan commit to?\"=\"idk wtv best and fair\". Read the answers carefully — they may request clarification, changes, or that you not proceed — and follow what they actually say.","tool_use_id":"toolu_01RY1kiN4jqjhb6y4vcewCEa"}]},"uuid":"8b485318-52bf-4eb8-9e60-fcb3f5146155","timestamp":"2026-08-08T18:00:44.105Z","toolUseResult":{"questions":[{"question":"Plan mode blocks me from creating the notepad file and the skill. How should I handle that?","header":"Notepad","options":[{"label":"Exit plan mode now, build both (Recommended)","description":"I exit, create devenv/SUBAGENT-LOG.md plus a /agentlog skill to view and append entries, then continue collecting results into it. The plan itself stays unfinished until the remaining agents land."},{"label":"Keep everything in the plan file","description":"Appendix A continues as the log. Nothing new is created until the plan is finalised and approved, then I lift it into a standalone notepad and skill in one pass."},{"label":"Wait for all agents, then do both at once","description":"Finish collecting, finalise the plan, and create the notepad and skill together as part of the same implementation step."}],"multiSelect":false},{"question":"Given eg loses 14.49% on the 20 pairs where BOTH arms genuinely build and test, but wins 9.71% where neither does — which reading should the plan commit to?","header":"Interpretation","options":[{"label":"Verification is the defect — target it (Recommended)","description":"Treat the verify-repair spiral as the mechanism and build the VERIFY runnability probe plus test-invocation card. Consistent with harness corr −0.612 and env-failures −0.442."},{"label":"The metric is the defect","description":"Sessions that skip real verification look cheap and win on tokens. That means the benchmark partly rewards not doing the work, and the endpoint needs changing before any tool conclusion is drawn."},{"label":"Both, and separate them first","description":"Run a read-only audit splitting the 20 both-built pairs to see whether eg's extra cost is genuine waste or genuine work, before committing the plan to either reading."}],"multiSelect":false}],"answers":{"Plan mode blocks me from creating the notepad file and the skill. How should I handle that?":"Keep everything in the plan file","Given eg loses 14.49% on the 20 pairs where BOTH arms genuinely build and test, but wins 9.71% where neither does — which reading should the plan commit to?":"idk wtv best and fair"},"annotations":{}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"e4911423-3fdc-4c6a-bcc3-ee41379479c3","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
