{"parentUuid":"76ce3b5e-b6a2-4724-ad75-8b803433b528","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cdqiq9NWLiywnm6ese5xj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Status**\n\n| cell | arm | n | TOKEN | median | 10% trimmed | wins |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| rep50 4-arm | eg | 49/49 | +1.35% | −4.16% | −7.65% | 24/49 |\n| | cmm | 49/49 | −5.95% | −2.9% | — | 22/49 |\n| | graphify | 48/49 | −0.50% | −8.1% | — | 18/48 |\n| G2 (rider) | eg vs base | 10 | −12.19% | −14.45% | — | 3/10 |\n| G3 (displacement) | eg vs base | 11 | −1.24% | −0.40% | — | 5/11 |\n| Gemini 300 | — | 207 | −8.78% | — | — | VM A terminated |\n| rep30 | — | — | — | — | — | VM B terminated, 52 unfinished |\n\n**Flags:** wt 0 · cmm SKIP 0 · graphify SKIP 0 · rep50 max-turns 1 · none arm-asymmetric in the prompt (18 differing lines, all checkout paths). Nothing running.\n\n**Changed — validation ran clean, plus two new integrity flags:**\n\n- **Graphs verified**: 49/49 present, **0 commit mismatches**, 0 of 310 under 50 KB. Caches small, no staleness. rep50 ran binary `8daf183ee29d`.\n- **NEW — shared `/tmp` leaks between concurrent cells.** `prometheus-9248` eg found `/tmp/goyacc`, `/tmp/goyacc-build/goyacc` built by *other instances'* sessions and spent 2 calls auditing foreign binaries. This can fabricate per-instance deltas and wants auditing before any number is quoted.\n- **NEW — answer-leak exposure** (from the earlier forensics): sibling checkouts share a parent, and `bat-3108` is a *later revision of the same repo containing the implemented feature*. eg mined it for 12 calls. Structural, not arm-specific.\n\n**Also retracted this cycle:** my \"−14.49% when both arms build\" claim. Re-running with a stricter definition moved it to **−0.89%** at n=17. It was a regex artifact — withdrawn.\n\nTwo workflows and one capability agent still running; full plan held until they land."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_detail