{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-08-08T18:04:36.380Z","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>ac6b623d590051c5d</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>REDACTED</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-suhaan-devenv/0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208/tasks/ac6b623d590051c5d.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Map 30 relation types to producers\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>All 30 relations audited by grep + read of `internal/sem/{types,provider,similarity}.go` and `internal/cli/{neighbors,impact,def,changed}.go`, cross-checked empirically by running `./entire-graph edges --profile full` on this repo itself (36352 edges, all 30 types present — repo: `/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph`, commit 607b2a4).\n\n**Format:** `RELATION | producer=file:line | structural|heuristic | consumers | notes`\n\n```\nDEFINES       | provider.go:2586                    | structural (tree-sitter symbol)      | [neighbors]                | 7368 edges, no dedicated verb\nCONTAINS      | provider.go:2599 (+2387,2420,4146)   | structural (parser container)        | [neighbors,def]            | def walks it for members; impact uses ContainerID field instead\nIMPORTS       | provider.go:2899 (extract:12865 importsFor) | heuristic (regex, per-lang) | [search,neighbors]         | line-anchored regex e.g. `#\\s*include\\s+[&lt;\"]([^&gt;\"]+)[&gt;\"]`, not AST\nCALLS         | provider.go:3287 (extract:13821 callLikeIdentifiers) | heuristic (regex `name(` scan + symtab resolve) | [search,neighbors,impact,changed,callsite] | JS/TS gets partial AST narrowing via jsScan\nCONSTRUCTS    | provider.go:3281,3287               | heuristic (same pipeline, redirected by resolved-target kind) | [search,neighbors(aliased into CALLS),impact,changed] | `if typeLikeKind(to.Kind) { relType = \"CONSTRUCTS\" }`\nASYNC_CALLS   | provider.go:3360 (extract:types.go:737) | heuristic (regex await/go/spawn)   | [search,neighbors,impact,changed] | only 1 edge on this repo (Go rarely matches await/spawn patterns)\nEXTENDS       | provider.go:3959/3987 (source:types.go:102,149,184) | heuristic (regex on signature; C# uses `I&lt;Upper&gt;` name convention) | [search,neighbors,def] | \nINHERITS      | provider.go:3961/3989 (mixins:types.go:222) | heuristic (derived from EXTENDS regex; PHP/Ruby mixin is its own body regex) | [search,neighbors,def] |\nIMPLEMENTS    | provider.go:3959 (source:types.go:107,130,175) | heuristic (regex on signature; Rust `impl X for Y` regex) | [search,neighbors,def] |\nOVERRIDES     | provider.go:9420 (join:9410-9412)    | structural-derived (deterministic name-join over resolved EXTENDS/IMPLEMENTS) | [neighbors,def] | inherits heuristic-ness of EXTENDS transitively but the join itself is exact\nUSES_TYPE     | provider.go:9009                     | heuristic (identifier scan in signature, no type-checker) | [search,neighbors,impact] |\nPARAM_TYPE    | provider.go:9063 (split:types.go:2073) | heuristic (paren-split text parse of signature) | [neighbors,impact]        | not in search's RELATED expansion list\nRETURNS_TYPE  | provider.go:9063 (split:types.go:2074) | heuristic (same text-split)          | [neighbors,impact]        | not in search's RELATED expansion list\nREADS_FIELD   | provider.go:9371 (regex:types.go:2473) | heuristic (regex `x.y`/`x-&gt;y`)       | [neighbors]                | no dedicated verb beyond generic\nWRITES_FIELD  | provider.go:9371 (assign-detect:9356)  | heuristic (same regex, `.Write` flag) | [neighbors]                |\nACCESSES      | provider.go:9371 (addr-of:9354)        | heuristic (same regex, `&amp;x.y`)        | [neighbors]                |\nHANDLES_ROUTE | provider.go:3450                     | heuristic (pattern, self-declared)   | [neighbors]                | route-literal string scan; NOT in search RELATED list despite being in fast-profile\nHANDLES_GRPC  | provider.go:3424 (source:types.go:385) | heuristic (parsed proto `rpc` kind + boundary conversion) | [neighbors] | 1 edge on this repo (testdata)\nHANDLES_GRAPHQL | provider.go:3424 (source:types.go:399,415,425,437) | heuristic (mix: parsed schema kind + regex `graphqlOperationRe`) | [neighbors] |\nHANDLES_TRPC  | provider.go:3424 (source:types.go:445) | heuristic (regex `trpcProcedureRe`)  | [neighbors]                | 1 edge on this repo\nHTTP_CALLS    | provider.go:3479                     | heuristic (pattern, self-declared)   | [neighbors]                |\nEMITS         | provider.go:3507 (source:types.go:327) | heuristic (regex `.emit\\|.publish\\|.dispatch\\|.broadcast(`) | [neighbors] | WEAK_PATTERN warning code attached\nLISTENS_ON    | provider.go:3507,3535 (source:types.go:328) | heuristic (regex `.on\\|.once\\|.subscribe(` + NestJS decorator pattern) | [neighbors] | only 2 edges here\nHANDLES_TOOL  | provider.go:2613                     | heuristic (pattern, self-declared)   | [neighbors]                | fast-profile emitted\nCONFIGURES    | provider.go:9236 (source:types.go:2153) | heuristic (pattern, self-declared) | [search,neighbors]         | fast-profile emitted\nSIMILAR_TO    | similarity.go:160                    | heuristic (algorithmic: MinHash/LSH near-dupe, not name/regex) | [search,neighbors] | search.go:3022 comment claims \"emitted at fast/full\" — FALSE, resolveProfile excludes it from Fast (provider.go:462)\nTESTS         | provider.go:8900 (name rule:types.go:280-297) | heuristic (pure name convention: TestFoo-&gt;Foo etc) | [search,neighbors] | CONFIRMED near-zero: 10 edges / 36352 total (0.03%) on this repo\nRESOURCE_DEPENDS_ON | provider.go:6825(HCL)/6878(Docker)/6938(k8s)/7962/8053/8237/8416/8499 | heuristic (regex per format: HCL ref, Dockerfile COPY --from, k8s manifest pattern) | [neighbors] | fast-profile emitted\nDATA_FLOWS    | provider.go:3397 (source:types.go:709 returnCallRe) | heuristic (regex return-flow patterns) | [neighbors,impact]        | impact gives it its own dedicated section\nFILE_CHANGES_WITH | provider.go:9282 (git:9261 gitutil.FileCochanges) | heuristic (git co-change statistics, no source parsing at all) | [neighbors,impact] | impact gives it its own dedicated section\n```\n\n**PRODUCER=NONE relations:** none. All 30 relation types in `provider.go:49-79`'s `relationTypes` have real emit sites and empirically produced ≥1 edge when run full-profile on this repo (verified via `entire-graph edges --profile full`, 36352 total edges, every type &gt;0). The task's premise of a declared-but-never-emitted relation does not hold for this codebase/version.\n\n**Heuristic-only relations (regex / name-convention / pattern, zero AST-node capture):** IMPORTS, CALLS, CONSTRUCTS, ASYNC_CALLS, EXTENDS, INHERITS, IMPLEMENTS, USES_TYPE, PARAM_TYPE, RETURNS_TYPE, READS_FIELD, WRITES_FIELD, ACCESSES, HANDLES_ROUTE, HANDLES_GRPC, HANDLES_GRAPHQL, HANDLES_TRPC, HTTP_CALLS, EMITS, LISTENS_ON, HANDLES_TOOL, CONFIGURES, SIMILAR_TO, TESTS, RESOURCE_DEPENDS_ON, DATA_FLOWS, FILE_CHANGES_WITH (27 of 30). Only DEFINES and CONTAINS are true tree-sitter-AST captures; OVERRIDES is a deterministic derived join (not text-pattern itself, but its inputs are). The tool's own self-declared `HeuristicRelationTypes` list (provider.go:512) names only 7 (HANDLES_ROUTE, HTTP_CALLS, EMITS, LISTENS_ON, HANDLES_TOOL, SIMILAR_TO, TESTS) — this **undersells** the real heuristic surface by 20 relations; CALLS itself (the most-used relation, 12636/36352 edges = 35% of the whole graph) is a regex identifier-before-paren scan, not AST call-expression traversal, and isn't flagged as heuristic anywhere in capabilities output.\n\n**Computed but no dedicated CLI consumer (only reachable via generic `neighbors --relation X`):** DEFINES, IMPORTS (search wir