{"parentUuid":"b624107e-9315-4e52-ba96-579818be998d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqiussVddMp6JECkcvxB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":842,"cache_read_input_tokens":798312,"output_tokens":1576,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":842,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1576,"cache_read_input_tokens":798312,"cache_creation_input_tokens":842,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":842},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cdqiukn6tfvADLHRjsfgP","type":"assistant","uuid":"322613c4-825c-4c19-975a-99d6a488f034","timestamp":"2026-08-08T18:04:52.125Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"322613c4-825c-4c19-975a-99d6a488f034","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqiussVddMp6JECkcvxB","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Practical answer, and there's one thing worth doing before you close it.\n\n**What survives your laptop shutting down:**\n\n| | survives? |\n|---|---|\n| GCP VMs (`graphbench-c/e/f`) and anything `nohup`'d on them | **yes** — independent machines |\n| All files: plan, `EG-FINAL-PLAN.md`, artifacts, results on the VM | **yes** |\n| The published artifact URL | **yes** |\n| **This session's background agents + 2 workflows** | **no — they die with the session** |\n| This conversation's context | no |\n\nSo the only thing actually at risk is the three in-flight investigations.\n\n**Your options, best first:**\n\n1. **Claude Code on the web — `claude.ai/code`.** Runs in Anthropic's cloud, so your laptop is irrelevant. This is the closest thing to \"just keep going.\" Caveat: it works against a GitHub repo, so it won't have your local `devenv/` files or your `gcloud` credentials to reach the VMs. Good for reasoning and code work on `entire-graph`; not for driving the benchmark.\n\n2. **Put long work on the VM itself.** Anything launched with `nohup` on `graphbench-c` keeps running after you disconnect — that's how every cell so far has run. If we want a cell going overnight, launching it there is the durable path, and I poll it whenever you're back.\n\n3. **`/schedule`** for a durable cloud cron (e.g. a daily status), instead of `/loop`, which dies with the session.\n\n**My recommendation, concretely:** the highest-value thing right now isn't a machine, it's that **the plan gets finalised before the context is lost.** Two workflows are still running, but I already have the load-bearing findings from all four investigations — including the one genuinely new tool defect (`entire graph grep` returning noise where plain grep returns a clean zero, costing ~19 turns on prometheus) and the fact that `EG_LITERALS` is built and was switched off.\n\nI'd rather write the final plan now with what's confirmed than lose it waiting on two workflows whose remaining value is marginal. Everything is already logged in Appendix A, so nothing measured gets lost either way.\n\nWant me to finalise the plan now so it's on disk before you shut down?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":842,"cache_read_input_tokens":798312,"output_tokens":1576,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":842,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1576,"cache_read_input_tokens":798312,"cache_creation_input_tokens":842,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":842},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cdqiukn6tfvADLHRjsfgP","type":"assistant","uuid":"ced3c08a-7c6a-4dec-8766-64f37313916a","timestamp":"2026-08-08T18:05:03.301Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
