{"parentUuid":"a77854f2-2499-497f-a4e8-c04569d875a7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqjjBjqSjfcwSPU4mk6Q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5458,"cache_read_input_tokens":834175,"output_tokens":2329,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5458,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2329,"cache_read_input_tokens":834175,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5458,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5458},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cdqjj4XFewnueMPAp5L1P","type":"assistant","uuid":"02bcc1e1-d747-45cc-9b7d-d09acd1d5b04","timestamp":"2026-08-08T18:15:39.341Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"02bcc1e1-d747-45cc-9b7d-d09acd1d5b04","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqjjBjqSjfcwSPU4mk6Q","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"That workflow is the most consequential yet — **all three proposals killed**, and it invalidates two sections of the plan I just wrote. The findings:\n\n## R-A (my leading lever) — mispriced by 5.2×\n\nThe first graph search lands at **assistant turn 2 of a median 85-turn session**, where `cache_read` is **12,231 tokens against a session mean of 63,137**. The call is the *cheapest message in the session*. My +4.3–6.0% priced the removed message at session-mean cost.\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| my estimate | +4.3% to +6.0% |\n| **corrected** | **+0.96%**, CI [+0.53, +1.38] |\n| n to demonstrate it | **19,504 pairs** |\n\nWorse — it's aimed the wrong way. Only 33/49 sessions call `search`; the other **16 never do, and those are the losing cohort** (non-callers pooled −1.02%, median −24.94%; callers **+6.30%**, median +12.61%). Universal injection charges the non-callers ~45k tokens for nothing.\n\n**`displace & win` = 19/21 (90.5%); `no-displace & win` = 6/28 (21.4%), AUC 0.838.** Calling is the *winning* behaviour. R-A removes the call in exactly the cohort where calling works.\n\nIt also found two genuine bugs: `echoPresearchPayload` has **no length check** (zero-byte payload → 0 bytes, exit 0 — the \"announced but never shipped\" failure), and the echo is **query-blind and header-less**, so any later search returns the turn-0 payload verbatim — an absorbing state.\n\n## ADD tasks — real, and far bigger than I said\n\nAn independent gold-patch labeller: **gold-MOD n=36 +13.59%; gold-ADD n=13 −23.19%** (median −18.03%). **Gold-ADD is 8 of the 25 drag instances and −10.68 of the −19.86 drag points — 54% of all drag.**\n\nBut the fix is refuted: the structural signal (\"does the issue name a symbol that resolves\") was tested offline and doesn't separate, and the `exact-symbol` signal is *already printed to the agent* with rank-1 exactness identical on ADD and MOD (0.36 vs 0.36). And **GEM300 inverts the effect** (MOD −14.13%, ADD +0.86%), so it isn't universal.\n\n## VERIFY probe — already shipped and already on\n\n`run_REP50.sh:141` sets `EG_VERIFY_PROBE=1`. It was on in rep50. And **21 of 25 losers got no VERIFY line at all**, so it's a no-op on 84% of the drag.\n\n---\n\nMy plan's §4.4 and §4.6 are now wrong, and §2.2's sizing was understated. I'm not rewriting it until the last audit lands — that one is specifically tasked with finding errors in my documents, and on this evidence it will find more."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5458,"cache_read_input_tokens":834175,"output_tokens":2329,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5458,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2329,"cache_read_input_tokens":834175,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5458,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5458},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cdqjj4XFewnueMPAp5L1P","type":"assistant","uuid":"9186a5d6-5765-4843-ba90-aed42cbaad82","timestamp":"2026-08-08T18:15:50.005Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
