{"parentUuid":"5ba855b6-7cea-44e1-980a-b7b06201dd69","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cdqjo54NBSb2ty6MkGPSo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Status**\n\n| cell | arm | n | TOKEN | median | LOO drop lombok | wins |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| rep50 4-arm | eg | 49/49 | +1.35% | −4.16% | −5.18% | 24/49 |\n| | cmm | 49/49 | −5.95% | −2.9% | — | 22/49 |\n| | graphify | 48/49 | −0.50% | −8.1% | — | 18/48 |\n| G2 (rider) | eg vs base | 10 | −12.19% | −14.45% | — | 3/10 |\n| G3 (displacement) | eg vs base | 11 | −1.24% | −0.40% | — | 5/11 |\n| Gemini 300 | — | 207 | −8.78% | — | — | VM A terminated |\n| rep30 | — | — | — | — | — | VM B terminated, 52 unfinished |\n\n**Flags:** wt 0 · cmm SKIP 0 · graphify SKIP 0 · max-turns 1 · no prompt asymmetry. Open integrity items unchanged (sibling leak 2/49 eg-only, shared `/tmp`, 371 KB junk patch, `EMPTY PAYLOAD` detector).\n\n**Changed:**\n- **Confirmed `EG_VERIFY_PROBE=1` was already set in `run_REP50.sh`** — two occurrences. So the VERIFY probe I proposed as a fix was live during rep50. That kills it as a new lever and confirms the workflow's prior-art call.\n- **New drag decomposition:** gold-ADD instances are **8 of 25 losers carrying −10.68 of the −19.86 drag points — 54% of all drag** from 8 instances. Largest concentrated cause found.\n- `drivers=2` are leftover shells from the killed FAB82 run, not active sessions (`live=0`, load 0.00). No spend.\n\nLast investigation (4-lens artifact/data audit) still running; holding the rewrite until it lands."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":919,"cache_read_input_tokens":842081,"output_tokens":682,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":919,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{