{"parentUuid":"716394f3-9652-48a9-8155-93fc334e86b6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqjzWSthX5SZTwhtJHFe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3096,"cache_read_input_tokens":852299,"output_tokens":1342,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3096,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":1342,"cache_read_input_tokens":852299,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3096,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3096},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqjzLS8xfrSULoHavXyp","type":"assistant","uuid":"4c3f59be-d4bf-4bba-9159-2e6c89af75af","timestamp":"2026-08-08T18:18:56.840Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"4c3f59be-d4bf-4bba-9159-2e6c89af75af","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqjzWSthX5SZTwhtJHFe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**No — and the data is unusually clean about it.**\n\n**By language, R² = 0.153** — language explains 15% of the variance, and the groups contradict themselves:\n\n| lang | n | TOTAL | median | wins |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Java | 5 | **+29.64%** | **−30.18%** | **1/5** |\n| C | 6 | +10.15% | +46.18% | 3/6 |\n| Ruby | 6 | +22.83% | +24.50% | **6/6** |\n| Rust | 5 | −42.58% | −33.52% | 2/5 |\n| Python | 10 | −8.47% | −6.31% | 4/10 |\n| PHP | 6 | −14.45% | −5.03% | 2/6 |\n| Go | 6 | −15.20% | −4.16% | 2/6 |\n\nJava is the tell: **+29.64% total but 1 win in 5 and a median of −30.18%.** That's `lombok-3674` (+6.09 pts alone) making the whole language look good while four of five Java instances lose. Any per-language config tuned on that number would be tuned on one instance.\n\n**By repo it's worse — the same repo doesn't agree with itself.** Only **5 of 14** repos with more than one instance are internally consistent:\n\n```\nlaravel   n=5  MIXED   [+51, −5, −59, −124, +39]\ntokio-rs  n=2  MIXED   [−114, +33]\nlombok    n=2  MIXED   [−19, +71]\nfmtlib    n=2  MIXED   [+62, −23]\nprometheus n=2 MIXED   [+17, −75]\n```\n\nSame repo, same language, same tool, same config — swings of 175 points between two instances.\n\n**So there is no repo type or language type that reliably wins.** That's the measured basis for the ledger already striking language/repo gating, and it's why I advised against the grouping workflow. The only grouping with real signal is **task kind** (gold-ADD = 54% of all drag), and even that inverts on GEM300.\n\nRuby 6/6 is the one clean-looking cell — but at n=6 against a ~100-point same-instance noise floor, that's what a coin flip looks like six times.\n\nNow relaunching the fix-finder with the parse error fixed (backticks inside the template literal)."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3096,"cache_read_input_tokens":852299,"output_tokens":1342,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3096,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":1342,"cache_read_input_tokens":852299,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3096,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3096},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqjzLS8xfrSULoHavXyp","type":"assistant","uuid":"4b92c629-463c-4683-babe-8483a06d7e26","timestamp":"2026-08-08T18:19:05.200Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"4b92c629-463c-4683-babe-8483a06d7e26","isSidechain":false,"type":"system","subtype":"stop_hook_summary","hookCount":2,"hookInfos":[{"command":"sh -c 'if ! command -v entire >/dev/null 2>&1; then exit 0; fi; exec entire hooks claude-code stop'","durationMs":3538},{"command":"node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/stop-review-gate-hook.mjs\"","durationMs":52}],"hookErrors":[],"hookAdditionalContext":[],"preventedContinuation":false,"stopReason":"","hasOutput":false,"level":"suggestion","timestamp":"2026-08-08T18:19:08.787Z","uuid":"a3d33afa-dcd0-4adc-81d1-d990e0ac9dc8","toolUseID":"83dd4f77-bc98-4a0b-baa2-270fb23f2d71","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
