{"parentUuid":"6fa4917b-06a4-4fef-8083-a8661b5cfe46","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqkXcF1hYTiuLV98ZPJh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Rewritten as a build plan. The core change is your framing: **eg already computes everything the agent needs — it just doesn't ship it in the one call the agent makes.**\n\n| the agent's next question | eg has it | why it never arrives |\n|---|---|---|\n| what else must change? | RELATED SITES | **can't emit at `TOPK≤5`** — cell ran 5 |\n| what else is in this file? | FILE OUTLINE | **default OFF**, not in `--help` |\n| what test covers this? | covering-test selection | only **8 of 33** payloads |\n| how do I run it? | derived VERIFY | same 8/33; 21/25 losers got none |\n| who calls this? | 12.6k CALLS edges | only via verbs with **0/49** adoption |\n\nSo the build is: **fewer source dumps, more answers**, and the removals pay for the additions —\n\n- bodies rank 5→2: **−8,232 B** (rank 3+ is read 0–11% of the time)\n- `--format` json→text: **−44%**\n- grep vendor filter: negative, and kills the one case where the graph is *worse than no tool*\n- **+** RELATED SITES, FILE OUTLINE, covering test + runnable VERIFY\n\nNet still negative, and one call now answers five questions instead of one.\n\nThree preconditions are currently violated and would silently invalidate any cell: **the binary is stale**, `run_3arm.sh`'s default binary is missing every recent payload feature, and fairness currently depends on a 9-pattern grep in another repo.\n\nOne thing I won't soften: I'm not attaching a predicted percentage. Eleven measured claims in this project have been retracted, seven of them mine. What's *certain* here is the byte arithmetic and that RELATED SITES was structurally off. What's *unproven* is whether answering those four questions up front actually cuts the agent's 24.6 exploration calls — and that's precisely what the gate is for. It's the first hypothesis in this whole effort where the mechanism is a capability being switched on rather than a correlation being chased.\n\nReady to implement on your approval — the plan is at `~/.claude/plans/stateless-napping-unicorn.md`."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4997,"cache_read_input_tokens":886655,"output_tokens":722,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4997,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":722,"cache_read_input_tokens":886655,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4997,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4997},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqkXTiZ3ZVWP2GSMr5b1","type":"assistant","uuid":"393a1fc0-3aac-4446-a988-2393cd568f50","timestamp":"2026-08-08T18:26:03.572Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
