{"parentUuid":"76122aa1-ecfd-42d5-bdc1-53514c35076e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqkkEzC5QVjJEUBo2z9L","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Fully verified now, and it's a structural finding that overturns my own plan again.**\n\nPayload is **median 98 lines. The agent reads the first 50.**\n\n| block | present | median line | reaches the agent |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| rank 1 | 33/33 | 1 | **100%** |\n| rank 2 | 32/33 | 16 | 91% |\n| rank 3 | 31/33 | 29 | 74% |\n| rank 4 | 29/33 | **52** | 45% |\n| rank 5 | 28/33 | **70** | 32% |\n| **RELATED SITES** | **0/33** | — | **never emitted at all** |\n| COVERING TEST | 8/33 | 62 | **38%** |\n| **VERIFY** | 8/33 | **80** | **25%** |\n\n**The answers sit below the cut.** VERIFY is generated at median line 80 — of the 8 payloads that have one, only **2 reach the agent**. Ranks 4–5 bodies occupy lines 52–70, pushing the answers further down. And RELATED SITES confirmed **0/33**.\n\n**This also kills a claim I made 20 minutes ago:** trimming emitted bytes saves *nothing*, because bytes past line 50 are discarded by the agent before entering context. They're never billed. So \"bodies rank 5→2 = −76% bytes\" is **zero token saving**, not a large one.\n\n**What that leaves is one change that is free by construction: reorder the payload so VERIFY and COVERING TEST come before ranks 3–5.** Same emitted bytes, same 50 lines delivered, but VERIFY delivery goes 2/33 → 8/33 and covering test 3/8 → 8/8. It cannot cost tokens because delivered volume is fixed by the agent's own cut.\n\n**Now the honest part about your 0.1% bar.** 0.1% of 145.6M = 145,600 tokens = **~2,971 per session**. One exploration call costs ~14k persist-tokens, so avoiding **one exploration call per five sessions** clears it. That's a low bar and the reorder plausibly clears it — but \"plausibly\" is not \"verified,\" and the effect is *behavioural*, not arithmetic. I can verify the mechanism (answers are below the cut, 100% reproducible) and the bar arithmetic. I cannot verify the token delta without a cell.\n\nI won't claim a verified ≥0.1% saving when what I have is a verified mechanism and an unverified response. Everything I've promised on this project has had to be retracted once; I'm not adding a twelfth.\n\nThe gate that would settle it is cheap: **12 pairs, mechanism-only — does VERIFY delivery rise from 2/33, and do exploration calls fall?** No token claim at that n. If exploration falls at all, 0.1% follows arithmetically."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1661,"cache_read_input_tokens":902810,"output_tokens":2706,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1661,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":2706,"cache_read_input_tokens":902810,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1661,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1661},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cdqkk3g48tPyz11CkVuL5","type":"assistant","uuid":"36e5d87e-2971-4575-83dd-87f0feef4d9e","timestamp":"2026-08-08T18:29:16.906Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
