{"parentUuid":"72213451-4af5-4d29-8fcf-fbf7cb7fab7c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqnCyTv89wiokRHPCnXy","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Progress: 1 of 13 items done, 1 attempted and failed, and 3 items died during implementation.** Nothing committed since plan approval.\n\n| # | item | status |\n|---|---|---|\n| **4.3a** | rebuild stale binary | ✅ **done** — `changed`/`verify` were being rejected, now resolve |\n| 4.2c | answers-first reorder | 🔄 attempted, **failed its own check**; and now **gutted** — VERIFY was its main payload |\n| 4.1a | bodies rank 5→2 | ❌ **dead** — bytes past line 50 are never billed, so zero saving |\n| 4.2a | `TOPK` 5→8 for RELATED SITES | ❌ **dead** — rank 6+ reaches the agent 2/33; it'd be truncated away |\n| 4.2c | VERIFY coverage 8/33 → 100% | ❌ **dropped by your call** |\n| **4.1c** | `graph grep` vendor/minified filter | ⬜ **next** — unaffected by the VERIFY decision |\n| 4.2b | FILE OUTLINE default on | ⬜ pending |\n| 4.1b | `--format` json→text default | ⬜ pending |\n| 4.4a | recover 287 dropped sessions | ⬜ pending — free power |\n| 4.4b | turn-cap censoring (2.75× arm-skewed, flatters eg) | ⬜ pending |\n| 4.4c | byte-count patch gate (admitted 1.89 MB) | ⬜ pending |\n| 4.3b | fix `AGENTS.md:72` denying a real feature | ⬜ pending |\n| 4.3c | document `verify`/`changed`/`def` | ⬜ pending |\n\n**The honest read:** three of the plan's headline items died within an hour of trying to build them, each caught by verification rather than by review. The plan was thinner than it looked when approved.\n\n**What survives is real but modest.** The strongest remaining item is `graph grep` filtering — it's the only measured case of the graph being *worse than no tool* (prometheus: one hit in minified vendored `d3.v3.js` where plain grep returned a clean zero, ~19 turns lost), it removes bytes, and it's independent of everything you just dropped.\n\nOn the reorder: without VERIFY it only promotes the covering-test note — 8/33 payloads have one, 3/8 currently reach the agent. That's ~5 sessions gaining \"which test covers this,\" which is pure code intelligence and unambiguously fair. Small. I'd finish it only because it's already half-written, not because it's load-bearing.\n\nStarting on `graph grep` unless you'd rather I go at the measurement fixes (4.4a–c) first — those are the ones that make the *next* number trustworthy, and one of them currently biases in eg's favour."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1629,"cache_read_input_tokens":937536,"output_tokens":951,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1629,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":951,"cache_read_input_tokens":937536,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1629,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1629},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqnCdjWgkCUKXXZW2Aoj","type":"assistant","uuid":"7604f4f4-20f2-4663-9a19-85e9a4d58edc","timestamp":"2026-08-08T18:48:05.338Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
