{"parentUuid":"f1ed23c4-13f0-4043-ad3d-e2364a20ab1f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cdqnz1C6tUyF15W1TBdWq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1561,"cache_read_input_tokens":958038,"output_tokens":2008,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1561,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":2008,"cache_read_input_tokens":958038,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1561,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1561},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqnypkoD9DW1T6DtVCZ2","type":"assistant","uuid":"7dd96b0a-5764-40fd-ae3b-bec15ce634d9","timestamp":"2026-08-08T18:58:14.229Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"7dd96b0a-5764-40fd-ae3b-bec15ce634d9","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cdqnz1C6tUyF15W1TBdWq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both behaviours correct, and the prometheus case is fixed:\n\n- **Real symbol** → 4 hits with enclosing symbols, unchanged\n- **Nonexistent symbol** → `(no direct hit for \"atan2|ATAN2\" - falling back to ranked search)`\n\nThat's the outcome that matters. Previously it would have reported **\"1 match\"** pointing at minified vendored d3; now the agent gets an explicit *no direct hit* — the actionable signal the baseline had, which is what let it pivot to the error string and pin the fix site on its next call.\n\nThe never-refuse fallback still runs, so this doesn't reintroduce the refusal failure mode (3 of 4 sessions once abandoned the tool after a single refusal)."}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1561,"cache_read_input_tokens":958038,"output_tokens":2008,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1561,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":2008,"cache_read_input_tokens":958038,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1561,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1561},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqnypkoD9DW1T6DtVCZ2","type":"assistant","uuid":"ade68223-0946-49ca-9def-76505df8069d","timestamp":"2026-08-08T18:58:17.780Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"ade68223-0946-49ca-9def-76505df8069d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cdqnz1C6tUyF15W1TBdWq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012ZFZUmGLbKxmudR94TEFgG","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/graphmark-bench && git add agentic-swebench/tools/_isvendor.py agentic-swebench/tools/eg-q && git commit -q -F - <<'MSG'\ngrep: filter vendored, minified and lockfile hits\n\nThe grep verb shelled out to `grep -rInE` over the whole worktree and filtered\nonly test paths, so it could return a match from a vendored bundle where plain\ngrep returned nothing.\n\nMeasured on prometheus-9248, an ADD task (make atan2 a first-class operator, so\nthe identifier does not exist in the repo yet). Both arms opened with the same\nquery:\n\n  baseline  grep -rn atan2 ... -> 31 B, no output\n  eg        graph grep atan2   -> 165 B, one hit in\n            web/ui/static/vendor/rickshaw/vendor/d3.v3.js, \"(1 matches)\"\n\nThe inversion is the defect. A clean zero is actionable -- it says the symbol is\nnot here, pivot -- and the baseline did pivot, grepping the error string from the\nissue text and pinning promql/engine.go:2089 scalarBinop, a gold edit site, on\nits next call. The eg arm never grepped the error string; it spent calls 3, 5, 6,\n7 and 8 re-confirming absence (call 7 re-derived this same d3 hit) and reached\nscalarBinop at calls 21-22. Roughly 19 turns, seeded by the tool's opening answer.\n\nThis is the only case in the rep50 corpus where the graph arm's output measured\nWORSE than having no tool at all, and the fix removes bytes rather than adding\nthem.\n\n_isvendor.py mirrors _istest.py's anchoring discipline: every directory\nalternative is anchored at a path-component boundary, so vendored_test.go,\nmy_vendor_api.py and internal/distributed/ do not match. Only high-confidence\nvendoring is listed -- dist/ and build/ are deliberately excluded from the list\nbecause they hold product source in enough repos that filtering them would\nsuppress real hits; a missed exclusion costs one noisy line, a wrong one hides\nthe answer.\n\nThe minified-line heuristic is set from measured ratios rather than guessed:\nminified d3 runs 0.048 spaces/char against 0.218 for both authored prose and\nauthored code, a 4.5x gap, so the cut at 0.08 sits in the empty middle.\n\nThe never-refuse fallback is untouched, so a filtered-to-empty grep still\ndegrades to the ranked search and prints an explicit \"no direct hit\" line rather\nthan refusing -- 3 of 4 live sessions once abandoned the tool permanently after a\nsingle refusal.\n\nVerified: 24 path cases and 4 line cases pass; a real symbol still returns its\nhits with enclosing symbols; a nonexistent symbol now reports no direct hit\ninstead of one vendored match.\nMSG\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Commit the grep vendor filter"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1561,"cache_read_input_tokens":958038,"output_tokens":2008,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1561,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":2008,"cache_read_input_tokens":958038,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1561,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1561},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqnypkoD9DW1T6DtVCZ2","type":"assistant","uuid":"54f23f6d-c3ea-42f0-904d-6cd8a172362d","timestamp":"2026-08-08T18:58:30.125Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn