{"parentUuid":"6985abee-e793-42f6-b487-6bec2db8f395","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cdqo2JsXswEJTGB4e7HsH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Plan progress — 2 done, 4 dead, 7 open**\n\n| # | item | status |\n|---|---|---|\n| 4.3a | rebuild stale binary | ✅ done |\n| **4.1c** | **`graph grep` vendor/minified filter** | ✅ **done — `1075f1d9`** |\n| 4.1a | bodies rank 5→2 | ❌ dead — bytes past line 50 never billed |\n| 4.2a | `TOPK` 5→8 | ❌ dead — rank 6+ reaches agent 2/33 |\n| 4.2c | VERIFY coverage | ❌ dropped (your call) |\n| — | answers-first reorder | ❌ reverted — gutted once VERIFY was out |\n| 4.4a | recover 287 dropped sessions | ⬜ next |\n| 4.4b | turn-cap censoring (2.75× arm-skewed) | ⬜ |\n| 4.4c | byte-count patch gate | ⬜ |\n| 4.2b | FILE OUTLINE default on | ⬜ |\n| 4.1b | `--format` json→text default | ⬜ |\n| 4.3b | fix `AGENTS.md:72` | ⬜ |\n| 4.3c | document `verify`/`changed`/`def` | ⬜ |\n\n**Changed since last update:** shipped the grep filter — the only measured case of the graph being *worse than no tool*. New `tools/_isvendor.py` mirrors `_istest.py`'s anchoring so `vendored_test.go`, `my_vendor_api.py` and `internal/distributed/` don't match; `dist/` and `build/` deliberately excluded from the filter list since they hold product source in some repos. Minified threshold set from measured ratios (0.048 vs 0.218 spaces/char) rather than guessed. 28 test cases pass; real symbols still return hits; nonexistent symbols now report *no direct hit* instead of one vendored match.\n\nNext: the 287-session recovery — free statistical power, no cell required, and it's the item that most improves whatever number comes next."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2060,"cache_read_input_tokens":959599,"output_tokens":701,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"st