{"parentUuid":"2fa0f00a-ed57-46fe-b2cb-bd70aad809b1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqoqiMU5MdD9LKvMnFV9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Plan progress — 2 done, 6 dead, 1 confirmed, 4 open**\n\n| # | item | status |\n|---|---|---|\n| 4.3a | rebuild stale binary | ✅ done |\n| 4.1c | `graph grep` vendor/minified filter | ✅ done — `1075f1d9` |\n| 4.1a | bodies rank 5→2 | ❌ dead |\n| 4.2a | `TOPK` 5→8 | ❌ dead |\n| 4.2c | VERIFY coverage | ❌ dropped |\n| — | answers-first reorder | ❌ reverted |\n| 4.4a | recover 287 sessions | ❌ dead — headline cell 49/49; real count 107, in other cells |\n| 4.4b | turn-cap censoring | ❌ dead — rep50 has **zero** max-turns; corpus ratio **1.00×**, not 2.75× |\n| **4.4c** | **byte-count patch gate** | 🔶 **real, but smaller than claimed** |\n| 4.2b | FILE OUTLINE default on | ⬜ |\n| 4.1b | `--format` json→text default | ⬜ |\n| 4.3b | fix `AGENTS.md:72` | ⬜ |\n| 4.3c | document `verify`/`changed`/`def` | ⬜ |\n\n**Changed — 4.4c partially confirmed, and the specific claim was wrong again.**\n\nVerified: only **7 patches over 100 KB exist across all cells**, and **2 are in rep50**:\n\n| | size | files | arm |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `gson-1093` | 700,465 B | 75 | **graphify** |\n| `carbon-2981` | 312,856 B | 2 | **baseline** |\n\nThe plan cited a **1,892,106 B / 1,708-file** patch on `gson-2479` in the eg arm. **No such patch exists** — nothing that size anywhere, and `gson-2479` isn't in rep50.\n\nWhat's actually true: the gate is a byte count and it does admit large patches. But the two in rep50 are in **graphify** and **baseline**, not eg — so this isn't inflating the eg headline. And `carbon-2981` at 2 files isn't obviously junk; a 312 KB two-file patch could be legitimate (generated locale data, say). Only `gson-1093` at 75 files looks like build output, and it's in the graphify arm.\n\nSo: real defect, worth fixing for future cells, **but it does not affect the eg number** and it's a hygiene item rather than a correction. I'll add the `*.class/*.jar/*.pyc` excludes since it's cheap, but I'm not going to describe it as fixing a bias.\n\nSeven of thirteen items now dead or downgraded. Next: **4.3b** (`AGENTS.md:72` denies a feature that exists) — I verified that one myself earlier against `root.go:576-594`, so it should hold."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1080,"cache_read_input_tokens":970485,"output_tokens":985,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1080,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":985,"cache_read_input_tokens":970485,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1080,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1080},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqoqaXRdzpkrnfg52but","type":"assistant","uuid":"31e4edd5-0ec2-4fe3-b2d1-22657f2016b3","timestamp":"2026-08-08T19:09:30.893Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
