{"parentUuid":"80615bce-5fc1-4853-ba19-0b6155026286","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cdqpa1ehQynNzzxTompEW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Plan progress — 3 done, 6 dead, 1 downgraded, 3 open**\n\n| # | item | status |\n|---|---|---|\n| 4.3a | rebuild stale binary | ✅ done |\n| 4.1c | `graph grep` vendor/minified filter | ✅ done — `1075f1d9` |\n| **4.3b** | **fix `AGENTS.md:72` denying a real feature** | ✅ **done** |\n| 4.1a · 4.2a · 4.2c · reorder · 4.4a · 4.4b | — | ❌ dead |\n| 4.4c | byte-count patch gate | 🔶 real, not eg-affecting |\n| **4.3c** | document `verify`/`changed`/`def` | 🔶 **partly false — see below** |\n| 4.2b | FILE OUTLINE default on | ⬜ next |\n| 4.1b | `--format` json→text default | ⬜ |\n\n**Changed:**\n\n**4.3b done.** The guide claimed `edges` has *\"no `--to`/`--from`/`--relation` filter\"*; the binary parses all three and the live test returned one filtered record instead of 36,359. Replaced with working examples and the list of 13 relation types this is the only route to — while keeping the honest steer that `neighbors` is still better for plain callers/callees.\n\n**4.3c is partly false.** The plan said `verify`, `changed` and `def` are in *neither* agent guide. Checked: `.entire/graph-agent.md` **already documents `changed` (line 99) and `verify` (line 102)** in its Reference table. Only `AGENTS.md` omits them, and `def` is genuinely missing from both. So it's a smaller fix than written — I'll add `def` and the two verbs to `AGENTS.md` only.\n\nThat's the seventh plan item to be wrong in its specifics, though this one is wrong in the useful direction — less work than claimed. Running tally: **3 items shipped, 6 dead, 3 downgraded on inspection, 2 genuinely open.**\n\nNext: 4.2b, FILE OUTLINE default. Its own measurement (77 greps landing on files the payload already named, 35 followed by a Read of that file) is the strongest evidence behind any remaining item — but given the record here I'll verify that measurement against the payload data before flipping the default."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2015,"cache_read_input_tokens":978438,"output_tokens":777,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2015,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":777,"cache_read_input_tokens":978438,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2015,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2015},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqpZpWySv3iZHZiipMyw","type":"assistant","uuid":"1c3157dd-27c4-468f-a3a4-c95b33222ea6","timestamp":"2026-08-08T19:19:01.153Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
