{"parentUuid":"d76e6675-b168-4fa4-900d-b32378ea23ca","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cdqpw458sNea568vAzZ4L","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Plan progress — 4 done, 6 dead, 2 downgraded, 1 open**\n\n| # | item | status |\n|---|---|---|\n| 4.3a | rebuild stale binary | ✅ done |\n| 4.1c | `graph grep` vendor/minified filter | ✅ done — `1075f1d9` |\n| 4.3b | fix `AGENTS.md:72` denying a real feature | ✅ done |\n| **4.3c** | **document `def` / `changed` / `edges`** | ✅ **done** |\n| 4.1a · 4.2a · 4.2c · reorder · 4.4a · 4.4b | — | ❌ dead |\n| 4.4c | byte-count patch gate | 🔶 real, not eg-affecting |\n| **4.2b** | FILE OUTLINE default on | 🔍 **verifying** |\n| 4.1b | `--format` json→text default | ⬜ |\n\n**Changed:**\n\n**4.3c done.** `AGENTS.md`'s reference table now carries `def` (971 LOC, was in neither guide), `changed`, and `edges --to X --relation R` — flagged as the only route to 13 relation types. `.entire/graph-agent.md` already had `changed` and `verify`, so no change needed there.\n\n**4.2b's evidence checks out in the source.** `search_outline.go:11-14` records it over **79 real agent sessions**: 77 targeted single-file greps landed on a file the payload had already named, 35 were immediately followed by a Read of that same file, and those Reads land a **median 109 lines** from anything the payload printed, with **47 of 53** landing inside another symbol the graph already indexes in that file.\n\nThat's a real measurement with a stated n — unlike most of what died today. But it's a measurement of *the problem*, not of the fix, and it predates the finding that the agent truncates at ~50 lines. FILE OUTLINE adds **+1,421 B**, which at ~40 B/line is ~35 lines — enough to push content past that cut. So the 8× return figure assumes the whole payload is read, which it isn't.\n\nVerifying where the outline block lands relative to line 50 before flipping the default. If it lands below, it's the same trap that killed `TOPK` 5→8."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1179,"cache_read_input_tokens":981343,"output_tokens":750,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1179,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":750,"cache_read_input_tokens":981343,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1179,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1179},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqpvrnytPFhy6KK7oLBW","type":"assistant","uuid":"3ea9fa21-25a1-47c6-8f5e-6a74d18038ed","timestamp":"2026-08-08T19:23:46.602Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
