{"parentUuid":"f830993c-963e-4e67-8d72-dd2a82944980","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdqqKEz5Zi9CoVccbKW5i","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Plan progress — 4 done, 7 dead, 1 downgraded, 1 open**\n\n| # | item | status |\n|---|---|---|\n| 4.3a | rebuild stale binary | ✅ done |\n| 4.1c | `graph grep` vendor/minified filter | ✅ done — `1075f1d9` |\n| 4.3b | fix `AGENTS.md:72` | ✅ done |\n| 4.3c | document `def` / `changed` / `edges` | ✅ done |\n| 4.1a · 4.2a · 4.2c · reorder · 4.4a · 4.4b | — | ❌ dead |\n| **4.2b** | **FILE OUTLINE default on** | ❌ **dead — see below** |\n| 4.4c | byte-count patch gate | 🔶 real, not eg-affecting |\n| 4.1b | `--format` json→text default | ⬜ last open item |\n\n**Changed: 4.2b is dead, for the same reason `TOPK` 5→8 died.**\n\nMeasured directly:\n\n| | bytes | lines | FILE OUTLINE at |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| off | 4,258 | 121 | — |\n| on | 5,673 | **153** | **line 122** |\n\nThe block lands at **line 122**, and the agent cuts at ~50. It is **never delivered**. Line 50 is byte-identical in both variants, and both show 1 ranked hit in the first 50 lines — so turning it on changes nothing the agent sees while adding 1,415 B to the emission.\n\nIts underlying measurement is real (79 sessions; 77 greps landing on already-named files; Reads landing a median 109 lines away). But that measured *the problem*, and it predates the truncation finding. Emitting the answer below the cut doesn't solve it — the same trap as RELATED SITES.\n\n**That's the third payload item to die on the truncation constraint**, which is now clearly the dominant fact about this tool: the agent reads ~50 lines of a ~98-line payload, and roughly half of everything the renderer produces is discarded before billing.\n\n**Tally: 4 shipped, 7 dead, 1 downgraded, 1 open** (`--format` json→text, which only affects real users since the benchmark already passes `--format text`).\n\nOnce that's done the plan is exhausted. Worth saying plainly: of 13 items, the ones that survived were 1 rebuild and 3 documentation/filter fixes — none of which will move a token number. The payload levers all died on a constraint no one had measured until today."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":949,"cache_read_input_tokens":983385,"output_tokens":839,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":949,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":839,"cache_read_input_tokens":983385,"cache_creation_input_tokens":949,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":949},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqqK2n7YF5mGgZ2x2ofm","type":"assistant","uuid":"d7b1af8b-0261-4cc6-84ac-335ecb2785d9","timestamp":"2026-08-08T19:28:49.262Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
