{"parentUuid":"fd34e970-100a-44ea-ae9d-7c2b5178e3d6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cdqqg4jmd8VqB5Wor1tD1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Verified — and it changes which fix is correct:\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| parser default (`search.go:1579`) | `Format: \"json\"` |\n| text payload | 4,274 B |\n| json payload | **8,071 B → 1.89×** |\n| doctrine agents read (`graph-agent.md:19, :96`) | prescribes **no `--format`** |\n| benchmark | passes `--format text` explicitly (9×) — unaffected |\n\nSo a real agent following the shipped doctrine gets **1.89× the bytes**. Real defect, benchmark-neutral.\n\nBut **flipping the parser default would break existing consumers** — anyone scripting `entire graph search --query X | jq` expects json today. The harm is concentrated in agents following the guide, so the targeted fix is the guide, not the default:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":630,"cache_read_input_tokens":985416,"output_tokens":1956,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":630,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1956,"cache_read_input_tokens":985416,"cache_creation_input_tokens":630,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":630},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cdqqfsfm7b8PoYRwR3kQQ","type":"assistant","uuid":"c4a31c3a-d727-4171-b7c8-4efa8e969a00","timestamp":"2026-08-08T19:33:34.223Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"c4a31c3a-d727-4171-b7c8-4efa8e969a00","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cdqqg4jmd8VqB5Wor1tD1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01ERQb5PEaz2HSgmGiPCxmjj","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph\npython3 - <<'PY'\nimport re\np='.entire/graph-agent.md'; s=open(p).read()\nbefore=s\ns=s.replace(\n '    entire graph search --repo . --profile full --query \"<the task or bug in one sentence>\"',\n '    entire graph search --repo . --profile full --format text --query \"<the task or bug in one sentence>\"')\ns=s.replace(\n '    locate  ->  entire graph search --repo . --profile full --query \"...\"',\n '    locate  ->  entire graph search --repo . --profile full --format text --query \"...\"')\nassert s!=before\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nprint(\"graph-agent.md: --format text added to both invocations\")\nPY\npython3 - <<'PY'\np='AGENTS.md'; s=open(p).read()\nbefore=s\ns=s.replace(\n 'entire graph search --repo . --query \"<the task or bug in one plain sentence>\" --format text --top-k 8',\n 'entire graph search --repo . --query \"<the task or bug in one plain sentence>\" --format text --top-k 8')\n# add the caveat where the format flag is described\ns=s.replace(\n \"- `--format agent` for compact ranked output with latency telemetry; `json`/`ndjson` for the full schema (completeness, partial failures, diagnostics).\",\n \"- **Pass `--format text`.** The parser default is `json`, which measures **1.89x** the bytes of the\\n  text payload for the same result (8,071 B vs 4,274 B on a real query) — every one of those bytes is\\n  re-read on every later turn. The default is left as `json` for backwards compatibility with scripts\\n  that pipe to `jq`; agents should always be explicit.\\n- `--format agent` for compact ranked output with latency telemetry; `json`/`ndjson` for the full schema (completeness, partial failures, diagnostics).\")\nassert s!=before\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nprint(\"AGENTS.md: format caveat added\")\nPY\ngrep -n \"format text\" .entire/graph-agent.md | head -3\ngrep -n \"1.89x\" AGENTS.md\nmise run check 2>&1 | grep -vE \"warning:|parser.c|^# github\" | tail -4","description":"Fix the doctrine format flag and run the gate","timeout":900000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":630,"cache_read_input_tokens":985416,"output_tokens":1956,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":630,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1956,"cache_read_input_tokens":985416,"cache_creation_input_tokens":630,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":630},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cdqqfsfm7b8PoYRwR3kQQ","type":"assistant","uuid":"aa5c6c19-e25f-4ff0-aaad-d2aed4c5f98d","timestamp":"2026-08-08T19:33:41.623Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"aa5c6c19-e25f-4ff0-aaad-d2aed4c5f98d","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"38dafe42-83f0-4ed0-8e18-96f2dfd0bc34","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01ERQb5PEaz2HSgmGiPCxmjj","type":"tool_result","content":"graph-agent.md: --format text added to both invocations\nAGENTS.md: format caveat added\n19:    entire graph search --repo . --profile full --format text --query \"<the task or bug in one sentence>\"\n96:    locate  ->  entire graph search --repo . --profile full --format text --query \"...\"\n27:- **Pass `--format text`.** The parser default is `json`, which measures **1.89x** the bytes of the\n[test:ci] ?   \tgithub.com/entireio/entire-graph/internal/sem/pgsql\t[no test files]\n[test:ci] ?   \tgithub.com/entireio/entire-graph/internal/sem/zsh\t[no test files]\n[test:ci] Finished in 116.67s\nFinished in 116.67s","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"52e35ac0-117d-4d1c-aa28-50c3b46e504f","timestamp":"2026-08-08T19:35:38.527Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"graph-agent.md: --format text added to both invocations\nAGENTS.md: format caveat added\n19:    entire graph search --repo . --profile full --format text --query \"<the task or bug in one sentence>\"\n96:    locate  ->  entire graph search --repo . --profile full --format text --query \"...\"\n27:- **Pass `--format text`.** The parser default is `json`, which measures **1.89x** the bytes of the\n[test:ci] ?   \tgithub.com/entireio/entire-graph/internal/sem/pgsql\t[no test files]\n[test:ci] ?   \tgithub.com/entireio/entire-graph/internal/sem/zsh\t[no test files]\n[test:ci] Finished in 116.67s\nFinished in 116.67s","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"aa5c6c19-e25f-4ff0-aaad-d2aed4c5f98d","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
{"parentUuid":"52e35ac0-117d-4d1c-aa28-50c3b46e504f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cdqqrp8FNZLgaYhwdL8au","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0144BNQJNqNcFvUg7n8euGrR","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"git add AGENTS.md .entire/graph-agent.md && git commit -q -F - <<'MSG'\ndocs: stop denying a shipped feature, and stop prescribing the fat format\n\nTwo defects in the guides agents actually read, both found by checking the docs\nagainst the binary rather than against each other.\n\n1. AGENTS.md claimed `edges` has \"no --to/--from/--relation filter\". The binary\n   parses all three (internal/cli/root.go:576,582,588) and a live query returns\n   one filtered relation record with its call-site evidence instead of the full\n   36,359-edge stream. That filter is the ONLY route to 13 of the 30 relation\n   types -- READS_FIELD, WRITES_FIELD, ACCESSES, HANDLES_ROUTE, HANDLES_GRPC /\n   GRAPHQL / TRPC, HTTP_CALLS, EMITS, LISTENS_ON, HANDLES_TOOL,\n   RESOURCE_DEPENDS_ON, DEFINES -- so the doc was costing the agent a capability\n   it had. Replaced with working examples, keeping the honest steer that\n   `neighbors` remains better for plain callers/callees.\n\n2. Both guides prescribed `entire graph search` with no --format, and the parser\n   default is json: measured 8,071 B against 4,274 B for the same query in text,\n   1.89x. Every one of those bytes is re-read on every later turn. Added\n   --format text to both prescribed invocations and documented why.\n\n   The parser default is deliberately NOT changed. The harm is concentrated in\n   agents following the guide; scripts that pipe `entire graph search` to jq\n   expect json today, and breaking them to fix a doc problem is the wrong trade.\n\nAlso added to AGENTS.md's reference table: `def` (971 LOC, was in neither\nguide), `changed`, and `edges --to X --relation R`.\n\nNote the benchmark is unaffected by (2) -- tools/eg-q passes --format text\nexplicitly in all 9 invocations. This is a real-user fix, not a cell fix.\n\nmise run check green (fmt, vet, race tests, build).\nMSG\ngit log --oneline -1","description":"Commit the documentation fixes","timeout":300000},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2205,"cache_read_input_tokens":986046,"output_tokens":849,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2205,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":849,"cache_read_input_tokens":986046,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2205,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2205},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdqqrRA8QRE7AQQmy1f5e","type":"assistant","uuid":"aa31ca48-7045-4167-baa8-9853b67e7980","timestamp":"2026-08-08T19:36:01.641Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"0d4c4262-2100-4779-8745-e855e0a78208","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/entire-graph","sessionId":"73009f6a-a642-4aaa-8da3-51eb6bcc5b49","version":"2.1.220","gitBranch":"main","slug":"stateless-napping-unicorn"}
